778:    const SITE_DATA = {"generated_at":"2026-11-27 04:00","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","funnel":{"toc_fetched":1616,"query_fetched":0,"fetched":674,"journal_matched":339,"scope_rejected":0,"scope_shadow":69,"suspended_skipped":0,"prescreened":40,"final":40,"curated":0},"papers":[{"id":"pmid_43085564","pmid":"43085564","doi":"10.1016/j.athoracsur.2026.11.003","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43085564/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-25","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Ann Thorac Surg","journal_full":"The Annals of thoracic surgery","tier":"B","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"1","jsub":[],"if_val":5.3,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 2区","warned":false,"study_type":"回顾性全国多中心数据库队列研究 · 风险预测模型开发与内部-外部交叉验证","category":"esophageal","category_label":"食管与纵隔肿瘤","score_total":72,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"基于STS全国数据库开发食管癌切除术后全因死亡长期风险预测模型，区分度中等（C指数0.68–0.70）","title_en":"Risk Model for Long-Term Mortality after Esophageal Cancer Resection - Analysis from the STS General Thoracic Surgery Database.","authors":"Kidane B, Chang SC, Seder CW, Bonnell L, David EA, Facktor MA, Inra ML, Pendleton AC et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Division of Thoracic Surgery, Department of Surgery, Western University, London, Ontario, Canada; Section of Thoracic Su…","authors_conclusion":"利用与长期生存状态数据链接的全国规模真实世界临床数据开发了10年全因死亡风险预测模型。该模型表现出卓越的性能，能准确预测所有患者、各风险评分组、各病理分期及新辅助治疗人群的观察生存模式。","ai_note":"作者称'excellent performance'，但报告的C指数仅0.68-0.70，属中等区分度，结论用词与数据存在张力；摘要提及做了校准评估和内部-外部交叉验证，但未给出任何校准统计量或外部验证的量化结果，信息不足；模型纳入术后并发症，该变量仅在术后可得，限制其术前决策用途；为10年模型但中位随访仅5.4年，长期段预测可靠性信息不足；无独立外部队列验证","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: There are no reliable risk models for predicting long-term survival after esophagectomy for esophageal cancer. We aimed to address this gap by developing and validating an all-cause mortality risk model to predict long-term survival probabilities in esophagectomy patients. METHODS: Adult patients undergoing esophagectomy for esophageal cancer in the Society of Thoracic Surgeons General Thoracic Surgery Database (2012-2023; 280 hospitals) were studied. Vital status was determined by linkage to Centers for Disease Control and Prevention National Death Index and/or Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services inpatient data. Risk model to estimate survival probability was developed using stratified multivariable Cox regression. Discrimination was assessed using bootstrap-adjusted concordance index and time-dependent ROC. Calibration was evaluated by comparing observed to predicted survival probabilities. Generalizability was evaluated by internal-external repeated cross-validation. RESULTS: 16,056 esophageal cancer patients were included. Median follow-up was 5.4 years, with mean age of 65.7 years (SD=9.2). Five-year survival for pathologic stages I-IV were 62.0%, 45.9%, 31.1% and 23.7%, respectively. Most patients (76.8%) received neoadjuvant therapy with 19.0% pathological complete response (pCR) overall. Patients with pCR demonstrated higher 5-year overall survival (61.8% vs 40.6%). Bootstrap adjusted C-index was 0.68 (95%CI=0.67-0.68); incorporating postoperative complications into the model increased C-index to 0.70. CONCLUSIONS: A 10-year risk prediction model for all-cause mortality was developed using national-scale, real-world clinical data linked to long-term vital status data. This model showed excellent performance with accurate prediction of observed survival patterns in all patients, across all risk score groups, and for all pathologic stages and neoadjuvant treatment.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086889","pmid":"43086889","doi":"10.1200/JCO.21.01308","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086889/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Sep-04","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Respir Res","journal_full":"Respiratory research","tier":"C","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":5.7,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 2区","warned":false,"study_type":"全国性回顾性队列研究（韩国理赔数据，倾向评分匹配，含竞争风险分析）","category":"advanced","category_label":"局晚期与晚期靶向/免疫","score_total":64,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"肺癌患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂较常规细胞毒化疗显著增加肺孢子菌肺炎风险：全国回顾性队列研究","title_en":"Increased risk of Pneumocystis jirovecii pneumonia associated with immune checkpoint inhibitors in lung cancer: a nationwide retrospective cohort study.","authors":"Cheon S, Kim KR, Lee H, Kim SH, Chung JE","affiliation_highlight":"College of Pharmacy, Hanyang University - ERICA campus, Ansan, Gyeonggi-do, Republic of Korea.","authors_conclusion":"ICI therapy is associated with a significantly increased risk of PJP compared with CC in patients with lung cancer. Given the potential severity of PJP, enhanced clinical vigilance is warranted during ICI treatment.","ai_note":"理赔数据库依赖诊断编码，PJP确诊与ICI暴露可能存在误分类，信息不足无法判断；摘要未报告TMP-SMX等预防用药情况，激素/预防用药混杂控制情况信息不足；事件绝对数较少（27 vs 66），亚组与药物种类分析均为探索性，nivolumab阴性结果以事件数不足解释，存在对三种药物阳性结果的选择性强调；未报告匹配后残余混杂评估与阳性对照，方法学细节信息不足。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Although immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) have led to a fundamental shift in lung cancer treatment, evidence regarding infections remains limited. Pneumocystis jirovecii pneumonia (PJP) is a rare but life-threatening opportunistic infection with high mortality if undiagnosed or untreated, making its risk assessment clinically critical. This study aimed to provide population-based comparative evidence on the risk of PJP between ICI therapy and conventional cytotoxic chemotherapy (CC) in patients with lung cancer. METHODS: Using the Korean nationwide claims data, we conducted a retrospective cohort study of patients newly diagnosed with lung cancer who initiated CC or ICI therapy between 2017 and 2022. After propensity score matching, incidence rate ratios (IRRs), Cox hazard ratios (HRs), and Fine-Gray subdistribution HRs (sHRs) were estimated. Sensitivity analyses were performed across clinically relevant subgroups, including those defined by advanced stage, surgical resection, radiotherapy, treatment line, ICI monotherapy, and systemic corticosteroid use. Additionally, risk patterns across specific ICI agents, including atezolizumab, pembrolizumab, durvalumab, and nivolumab, were evaluated in an exploratory analysis. RESULTS: After matching, 13,426 patients were included in each group. During follow-up, 27 and 66 PJP events occurred in the CC and ICI groups, respectively, corresponding to IRs of 3.35 and 7.77 per 1,000 person-years. ICI therapy was associated with a significantly higher risk of PJP (adjusted IRR 2.26, 95% CI 1.46-3.59; adjusted HR 2.83, 95% CI 1.81-4.44; adjusted sHR 2.63, 95% CI 1.68-4.12). In the exploratory analysis, significantly elevated IRRs, HRs, and sHRs were observed for durvalumab, pembrolizumab, and atezolizumab, while no clear association was observed for nivolumab because of the limited number of events. This association remained robust and consistent across various clinical contexts including cohorts defined by disease stage, treatment line, the use of monotherapy, and patients without systemic steroid exposure. CONCLUSIONS: ICI therapy is associated with a significantly increased risk of PJP compared with CC in patients with lung cancer. Given the potential severity of PJP, enhanced clinical vigilance is warranted during ICI treatment.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43095171","pmid":"43095171","doi":"10.34133/cancomm.0069","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43095171/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Cancer Commun (Lond)","journal_full":"Cancer communications","tier":"A","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"2","jsub":[],"if_val":28.4,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 1区","warned":false,"study_type":"基础机制研究 · 单细胞/体外/小鼠移植瘤模型，含药理抑制与免疫联合验证","category":"esophageal","category_label":"食管与纵隔肿瘤","score_total":59,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"ESCC中PKN2经FOXC1-CXCL8轴诱导中性粒细胞胞外诱捕介导T细胞排斥、导致免疫治疗耐药的机制研究","title_en":"PKN2 Drives Immunotherapy Resistance by Inducing Neutrophil Extracellular Trap-Mediated T Cell Exclusion through the FOXC1-CXCL8 Pathway in Esophageal Squamous Cell Carcinoma.","authors":"Wu H, Chen Z, Wang Z, Zhao Z, Jiang H, Li Z, Zhang S, Fang K et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Endoscopy Center, Shanghai East Hospital, School of Medicine, Tongji University, Shanghai, P.","authors_conclusion":"PKN2通过FOXC1-CXCL8-中性粒细胞调控网络关键介导ESCC免疫抑制；靶向该通路可能是克服免疫排斥、增强T细胞浸润并改善ESCC免疫治疗疗效的有效策略","ai_note":"纯临床前研究，无患者样本量与生存/疗效数据，摘要提及'相关性与生存分析'但结果部分未报告任何临床结局数值；'PKN2表达显著升高'无定量或统计值；P值仅报显著性而无效应量/CI，样本量（细胞系、每组小鼠数）信息不足","abstract_en":"Background: Esophageal squamous cell carcinoma (ESCC) is a highly aggressive cancer that shows limited response to immunotherapy. The mechanisms underlying immune evasion in ESCC remain unclear. This study aims to identify key regulators of immune exclusion in ESCC and assess their potential as therapeutic targets to enhance treatment efficacy. Methods: Single-cell and bulk transcriptomic analyses were conducted to identify genes associated with immune exclusion in ESCC. Immunohistochemistry was used to validate protein expression in ESCC and adjacent normal tissues. Functional experiments, including pharmacologic inhibition and mouse xenograft models, were employed to investigate the roles of neutrophils and the protein kinase N2 (PKN2)-forkhead box C1 (FOXC1)-C-X-C motif chemokine ligand 8 (CXCL8) pathway in shaping the tumor immune microenvironment. Neutrophil extracellular trap formation was assessed using immunofluorescence, electron microscopy, and enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay. Correlation and survival analyses were performed to link molecular findings with clinical outcomes. Results: Integrative analysis of single-cell transcriptomic data identified PKN2 as a critical contributor to immune exclusion in ESCC. Comparison of immune-reactive and nonreactive tumor groups revealed markedly elevated PKN2 expression in immune-excluded tumors. Mechanistically, PKN2 phosphorylates FOXC1 at threonine 232, preventing its interaction with the E3 ligase tripartite motif-containing 29 and inhibiting its proteasomal degradation. This results in FOXC1 stabilization, leading to a subsequent increase in CXCL8 secretion, a key neutrophil chemoattractant. The PKN2-FOXC1-CXCL8 signaling cascade recruits neutrophils, promoting neutrophil extracellular trap formation and contributing to immune exclusion. Furthermore, targeting the PKN2 pathway restored CD8+ T cell infiltration (P < 0.001) and synergistically enhanced anti-programmed cell death protein 1 efficacy, leading to a significantly lower tumor burden compared to monotherapy (P < 0.001). Conclusions: PKN2 critically mediates immune suppression in ESCC through the FOXC1-CXCL8-neutrophil regulatory network. Targeting this pathway may provide an effective strategy to overcome immune exclusion, enhance T cell infiltration, and improve the efficacy of immunotherapy in ESCC.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43085573","pmid":"43085573","doi":"10.1016/j.chest.2026.10.050","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43085573/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-25","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Chest","journal_full":"Chest","tier":"B","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":9.8,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 1区","warned":false,"study_type":"PVDOMICS多组队列的观察性二次分析（横断面关联研究，按WSPH分组与性别/绝经状态分层）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":57,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"DHEA-S在各病因肺高压中均降低，但其与疾病严重度的关联主要集中于1组女性（PVDOMICS）","title_en":"DHEA-S in Pulmonary Hypertension: Insights from PVDOMICS.","authors":"Garry JD, Chacon-Barahona J, Chung SJ, Frantz R, Rischard F, Hassoun P, Mathai S, Simpson C et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Vanderbilt University Medical Center, Division of Cardiovascular Medicine, Nashville, Tennessee, United States.","authors_conclusion":"Lower DHEA-S is a consistent feature across PH etiologies, but its association with disease severity appeared most prominent in females with Group 1 PH. Modulation of DHEA-S levels or the pathways governing its regulation may represent a therapeutic target in PH, warranting further mechanistic study.","ai_note":"观察性横断面数据，无法支持'治疗靶点'这一推断性表述；绝经状态分层为探索性分析，'appeard stronger'未提供分层效应量、交互检验P值或CI，无法判断差异是否具有统计学意义；摘要强调最显著的1组女性亚组数值，而2组女性、3组男性仅有定性描述（'not pulmonary hemodynamics or 6MWD'），存在选择性强调；未见DHEA-S测量时点与血流动力学检查的时间关系、混杂因素（如年龄、合并用药、激素替代治疗）控制情况的说明。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Dehydroepiandrosterone sulfate (DHEA-S) associates with disease severity in pulmonary hypertension (PH). However, prior studies focused on Group 1 disease; it is unknown whether DHEA-S associates with PH severity in other etiologies. It also remains unclear if DHEA-S associations with PH severity differ by sex or menopausal status. RESEARCH QUESTION: Do associations between DHEA-S and measures of PH severity differ by PH etiology, sex, or menopausal status? STUDY DESIGN AND METHODS: We analyzed data from PVDOMICS, including 85 healthy controls and 710 participants with PH. Venous plasma DHEA-S levels were measured by ultraperformance liquid chromatography mass spectrometry. Multivariable regression models were used to examine associations between DHEA-S levels and invasive hemodynamics, right ventricular (RV) systolic function, and six-minute walk distance (6MWD). Analyses were stratified by sex and WSPH group, with exploratory stratification by menopausal status among subjects with Group 1 PH. RESULTS: DHEA-S levels were lower in all WSPH Groups compared with controls (adjusted p<0.01 for all). Associations between DHEA-S levels and PH severity metrics appeared most prominent in females with Group 1 PH. A doubling of DHEA-S was associated with a 2.8 mmHg (95% CI 1.6-4.1) lower mean pulmonary artery pressure, 3.2% (95% CI 2.0-4.4%) higher RV ejection fraction, and 22m (95% CI 11-33) farther 6MWD (all p<0.01). Higher DHEA-S associated with better RV function, but not pulmonary hemodynamics or 6MWD in females with Group 2 PH and males with Group 3 PH. In Group 1 PH, associations between DHEA-S and measures of PH severity appeared stronger in post-menopausal compared with premenopausal females. INTERPRETATION: Lower DHEA-S is a consistent feature across PH etiologies, but its association with disease severity appeared most pronounced in females with Group 1 PH. Modulation of DHEA-S levels or the pathways governing its regulation may represent a therapeutic target in PH, warranting further mechanistic study.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43097421","pmid":"43097421","doi":"10.1159/res/aepag016","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43097421/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Oct-05","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Respiration","journal_full":"Respiration; international review of thoracic diseases","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":2.6,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"叙述性综述/观点评述 · 提出'诊断链'框架与良性活检解读规则（无原始数据）","category":"nodule","category_label":"肺结节与早筛管理","score_total":54,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"full","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"外周肺病灶良性活检结果的解读悖论：假性安心与诊断过度的风险分析","title_en":"The Benign Biopsy Paradox: False Reassurance and Diagnostic Overreach in Peripheral Pulmonary Lesions.","authors":"Rozman A, Shah PL","affiliation_highlight":"Faculty of Medicine, University of Ljubljana, Ljubljana, Slovenia.","authors_conclusion":"A benign biopsy result can be trusted only when it is specific, representative, concordant with imaging, and obtained after confirmed lesion access. Nonspecific benign findings, atypia, suspicious results, and nondiagnostic samples should not be considered reassuring when pretest probability remains elevated. Conversely, residual uncertainty should not trigger indefinite escalation. Rational management requires both escalation rules and stopping rules, informed by baseline malignancy risk, biopsy quality, lesion behaviour over time, patient fitness, and whether further tissue acquisition is realistically likely to change clinical management.","ai_note":"观点性综述，摘要未提供任何原始数据、样本量或验证性分析，所提'诊断链'（tool/access→navigation→position confirmation→sampling→pathology→final clinic-radiologic diagnosis）框架与升级/停止规则均为概念性建议，信息不足：无证据等级、无引用文献支撑、无规则的敏感度/特异度或对临床结局影响的量化；'robotic bronchoscopy 仅缩小 access/stability gap、CBCT 仅缩小 position confirmation gap'的论断在摘要中无比较数据支持。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Peripheral pulmonary lesions are increasingly detected through widespread computed tomography use, incidental imaging, and low-dose CT lung cancer screening programs. Diagnostic techniques have advanced substantially, including radial endobronchial ultrasound, virtual and electromagnetic navigation bronchoscopy, ultrathin bronchoscopy, cryobiopsy, cone-beam CT (CBCT), augmented fluoroscopy, and robotic-assisted bronchoscopy. Despite this rapid technological evolution, the interpretation of benign or nonmalignant biopsy results remains one of the most consequential and underappreciated clinical challenges in pulmonary medicine. SUMMARY: A benign biopsy result from a peripheral pulmonary lesion must not be interpreted as a single, unambiguous entity. Specific benign diagnoses, nonspecific benign findings, atypia, suspicious results, and nondiagnostic samples each carry a distinct residual probability of malignancy and different implications for subsequent management. Recent consensus recommendations mandate a strict definition of diagnostic yield, in which only specific malignant diagnoses and specific benign diagnoses sufficient to inform patient care are counted as truly diagnostic. Follow-up data are essential for calculating diagnostic accuracy, sensitivity for malignancy, negative predictive value, and false-negative rates - but should not retroactively reclassify nonspecific or nondiagnostic index results as diagnostic. We propose that the diagnostic process be understood as a chain: tool/access → navigation → position confirmation → sampling → pathology → final clinic-radiologic diagnosis. Failure at any link may create a diagnostic gap and produce a falsely reassuring result. Newer technologies address different links: robotic bronchoscopy primarily narrows the access and stability gap, while CBCT and augmented fluoroscopy primarily narrow the position confirmation gap. Neither technology - alone or combined - closes the sampling, pathology, or clinical concordance gaps. KEY MESSAGES: A benign biopsy result can be trusted only when it is specific, representative, concordant with imaging, and obtained after confirmed lesion access. Nonspecific benign findings, atypia, suspicious results, and nondiagnostic samples should not be considered reassuring when pretest probability remains elevated. Conversely, residual uncertainty should not trigger indefinite escalation. Rational management requires both escalation rules and stopping rules, informed by baseline malignancy risk, biopsy quality, lesion behavior over time, patient fitness, and whether further tissue acquisition is realistically likely to change clinical management.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43084859","pmid":"43084859","doi":"10.1016/j.smrv.2026.102412","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43084859/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-23","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Sleep Med Rev","journal_full":"Sleep medicine reviews","tier":"B","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":["综述"],"if_val":11.6,"zone":"JCR Q1","warned":false,"study_type":"系统综述与Meta分析（Bland-Altman一致性、相关性及诊断准确性汇总，含亚组/meta回归与GRADE评级）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":53,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"自动事件检测算法与人工判读AHI的一致性及诊断准确性：系统综述与荟萃分析显示总体均值差接近零但异质性极高、敏感度偏低","title_en":"Positive airway pressure automatic event detection versus manual scoring of the apnea hypopnea index: A systematic review and meta-analysis of agreement and diagnostic performance.","authors":"Messineo L, Bakker JP, Noah WH, White DP","affiliation_highlight":"Division of Sleep and Circadian Disorders, Departments of Medicine and Neurology, Brigham & Women's Hospital & Harvard M…","authors_conclusion":"AED与人工判读指标相当，但研究间存在显著异质性；当前设备可能低估AHI，且存在不可忽略的假阴性率。","ai_note":"总体均值差接近零（P=0.38）被表述为'相当'，但I2=98%、CoE仅low，汇总值掩盖了厂商间巨大差异，结论的确定性有限；'当前设备低估AHI'主要由事后meta回归的逐年趋势（-5.62 events/h per decade）支撑，属探索性分析，且与总体均值差为负但不显著的结果口径不完全一致；假阴性论断依赖AHI≥10时敏感度0.70，但该分析仅9项研究、CoE为very-low；敏感度/特异度亚组样本量小（8–9项研究）。","abstract_en":"RATIONALE: Automatic event detection (AED) algorithms are proprietary, most available evidence derives from post-market studies, and a comprehensive synthesis of their performance is lacking. METHODS: Pubmed, EMBASE and CENTRAL were searched for studies in OSA adults evaluating: 1) Bland-Altman mean difference between AED-derived (any manufacturer) and manually-scored apnea-hypopnea index (AHI), 2) correlation coefficient between AED-derived and manual AHI, 3) sensitivity/specificity for detecting manually-scored AHI≥5 or ≥10 events/h. Sources of heterogeneity were explored through subgroup analyses and meta-regressions. GRADE was used to rate certainty of evidence (CoE). RESULTS: Automatic and manual scoring of AHI were similar (mean difference [95%CI]; -0.53 [-1.74, 0.57] events/h, P = 0.38, I2 = 98%, N = 23 studies, 1990 participants; CoE: low). Heterogeneity was likely explained by manufacturer, and by a temporal trend towards increasing underestimation (-5.62 [-8.14, -3.10] events/h per decade, P < 0.001). Correlation of AHI between methods was high (0.79 [0.71, 0.84], I2 = 91%, N = 16; CoE: low). Sensitivity was lower than specificity at AHI≥5 (0.82 [0.66, 0.92]; 0.87 [0.82, 0.91]; N = 8) and at AHI≥10 events/h (0.70 [0.56, 0.81]; 0.92 [0.81, 0.97]; N = 9), with low-to-very-low CoE. CONCLUSIONS: AED and manual scoring exhibit comparable metrics, but substantial variability across studies exists. Current devices may underscore AHI and have a non-negligible rate of false negatives.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43085108","pmid":"43085108","doi":"10.1016/j.intimp.2026.117715","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43085108/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-25","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Int Immunopharmacol","journal_full":"International immunopharmacology","tier":"C","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"5","jsub":[],"if_val":5.6,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 2区","warned":false,"study_type":"双中心回顾性真实世界研究 · PSM(1:2)匹配后PFS/OS分析","category":"perioperative","category_label":"围术期与新辅助治疗","score_total":52,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"局限期小细胞肺癌根治性放化疗后巩固PD-L1抑制剂治疗的真实世界疗效与安全性：倾向性评分匹配的回顾性研究","title_en":"Effectiveness and safety of consolidation PD-L1 inhibitor therapy after chemoradiotherapy in non-progressive limited-stage small cell lung cancer: a multicenter real-world study.","authors":"Zhu J, Li M, Xu J, Wang X, Zhu C, Liu Z, Wang K, Zhao J et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Radiation Oncology, Shandong Cancer Hospital and Institute, Shandong First Medical University and Shandong…","authors_conclusion":"Consolidation PD-L1 inhibition after definitive CRT was associated with improved survival and disease control with manageable safety in real-world patients with LS-SCLC.","ai_note":"回顾性非随机设计，虽经PSM仍无法排除适应证偏倚（体能状态好、无进展者才接受巩固治疗）；摘要未报告任何HR或95%CI，仅给出中位数与P值，效应量精度信息不足；所用PD-L1抑制剂具体药物与剂量未说明；巩固治疗启动时机与CRT后反应的分析均为探索性且未见显著交互作用，不宜作为依据；OS在巩固组未达到，随访34.7个月下中位OS比较成熟度有限；次要终点（胸腔内外PFS、BMFS）被突出报告，但主要终点PFS/OS本身已为阳性，无主要终点阴性问题。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: The real-world effectiveness and safety of consolidation immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) for limited-stage small-cell lung cancer (LS-SCLC) remain unclear. This study aimed to evaluate the real-world outcomes of this approach. MATERIALS AND METHODS: We retrospectively evaluated patients with LS-SCLC who received definitive chemoradiotherapy (CRT) at two institutions between January 2022 and January 2025. They were grouped by receipt of consolidation immunotherapy (programmed death-ligand 1 [PD-L1] inhibitor) and propensity score matched (1:2). The primary outcome measures were progression-free survival (PFS) and overall survival (OS); the secondary outcome measures were brain metastasis-free survival (BMFS), intrathoracic and extrathoracic PFS, and safety. RESULTS: 211 matched patients were evaluated (non-consolidation immunotherapy, 140; consolidation immunotherapy, 71). The median follow-up was 34.7 months. Consolidation immunotherapy was associated with longer PFS (18.9 vs. 12.1 months; p = 0.026), OS (not reached vs. 31.6 months; p < 0.001), intrathoracic and extrathoracic PFS (p = 0.025 and 0.006) and was an independent prognostic factor for PFS and OS. In exploratory analyses stratified by best response to CRT, consolidation immunotherapy was associated with longer OS in the PR subgroup, but no statistically significant treatment-by-response interaction was observed for either OS or PFS. In the consolidation immunotherapy group, OS was similar across initiation intervals, whereas PFS was most favorable when PD-L1 inhibitors were initiated 4-6 weeks after CRT. Prophylactic cranial irradiation (PCI) was associated with longer BMFS; safety was comparable between groups. CONCLUSION: Consolidation PD-L1 inhibition after definitive CRT was associated with improved survival and disease control with manageable safety in real-world patients with LS-SCLC.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43097170","pmid":"43097170","doi":"10.1016/j.resinv.2024.03.007","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43097170/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-26","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Lung","journal_full":"Lung","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":4.3,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"单中心单臂Phase II前瞻性研究（诊断效能与安全性）","category":"nodule","category_label":"肺结节与早筛管理","score_total":52,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"ILD合并外周肺病变患者中r-EBUS引导TBNA序贯TBB的诊断效能与安全性：单臂II期研究（诊断率78.7%）","title_en":"Endobronchial Ultrasound-Guided Transbronchial Needle Aspiration and Transbronchial Biopsy for Peripheral Pulmonary Lesions in Patients with Interstitial Lung Disease: A Phase Ⅱ Prospective Study.","authors":"Ito T, Nishida K, Baba T, Chretien B, Kimura H, Koyama J, Hayai S, Kinoshita F et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Respiratory Medicine, Nagoya University Graduate School of Medicine, 65 Tsurumai-cho, Showa Ward Nagoya, N…","authors_conclusion":"This phase II study suggested that sequential r-EBUS-guided TBNA followed by TBB might be a useful diagnostic approach for PPLs in patients with ILD, with no serious adverse events observed.","ai_note":"单臂无对照，无法与TBB单独或其它导航方式比较，'改善r-EBUS表现在中'的70.8%分母仅24例（占47例的一半），该子集入选标准摘要未说明，信息不足；P<0.001所对照的零假设诊断率阈值摘要未给出，信息不足；作者结论称'无严重不良事件'，但ILD人群气胸发生率2/47（4.3%）且1例需胸腔引流，属需关注的安全信号；结论中'可能有用'缺少比较性证据支撑。","abstract_en":"PURPOSE: The addition of radial endobronchial ultrasound (r-EBUS)-guided transbronchial needle aspiration (TBNA) to transbronchial biopsy (TBB) may improve the relationship between the r-EBUS probe and target lesion, helping overcome the limited efficacy of TBB alone. However, the efficacy and safety of this sequential procedure for peripheral pulmonary lesions (PPLs) in patients with interstitial lung disease (ILD) remain unknown. This study evaluated the diagnostic performance and safety of r-EBUS-guided TBNA followed by TBB for PPLs in patients with ILD. METHODS: In a single-center, single-arm, phase Ⅱ trial, patients with PPLs and concomitant ILD were prospectively enrolled to undergo r-EBUS-guided TBNA followed by TBB under virtual bronchoscopy navigation and fluoroscopy. The primary endpoint was the diagnostic yield for PPLs. Secondary outcomes included improvement in r-EBUS findings, procedural time, and safety. RESULTS: Forty-seven patients were analyzed, excluding one patient who was found to have an endobronchial lesion during bronchoscopy. The median maximum lesion diameter on computed tomography was 22.3 mm (range: 11.2-70.3 mm). The diagnostic yield for PPLs in patients with ILD was 78.7% (37/47 patients, lower 95% confidence interval: 66.6%, P < 0.001). Improvement in r-EBUS findings during TBNA/TBB procedures was observed in 70.8% (17/24 patients, 95% confidence interval: 48.9-87.4%). The median procedural time was approximately 50 min. Pneumothorax occurred in two patients, one of whom required thoracic drainage. CONCLUSION: This phase II study suggested that sequential r-EBUS-guided TBNA followed by TBB might be a useful diagnostic approach for PPLs in patients with ILD, with no serious adverse events observed. TRIAL REGISTRATION: jRCT1042230076.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43094709","pmid":"43094709","doi":"10.20517/evcna.2024.69","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43094709/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Front Immunol","journal_full":"Frontiers in immunology","tier":"C","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"5","jsub":[],"if_val":7.0,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 2区","warned":false,"study_type":"公共单细胞/转录组数据再分析 + 单中心125例临床队列关联研究 + 细胞与皮下移植瘤功能验证","category":"advanced","category_label":"局晚期与晚期靶向/免疫","score_total":50,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"单细胞与125例临床队列分析显示HAX1在肺腺癌疾病进展及淋巴结/脑转移上皮细胞中表达升高，高表达与淋巴结转移（调整T分期后OR=2.581, 95%CI 1.161-5.742）及更短总生存相关，并伴细胞周期程序上调与免疫细胞浸润反向相关","title_en":"Single-cell and clinical analyses reveal elevated HAX1 expression and cell-cycle-associated programs during metastatic progression of lung adenocarcinoma, particularly in brain metastasis.","authors":"Xie T, He W, Li Z, Dong H, Li X, Liu C, Zhong C, Zhang H et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Thoracic Surgery, Zhongda Hospital, Southeast University, Nanjing, Jiangsu, China.","authors_conclusion":"HAX1与LUAD转移进展密切相关，具有淋巴结受累的强临床证据及脑转移上皮细胞中的可重复富集；其与细胞周期程序和免疫细胞浸润的关联，以及在G1/S进程中的功能作用，支持进一步研究HAX1在转移适应与肿瘤-免疫互作中的作用","ai_note":"摘要未说明预设主要终点，OS关联仅以'更短总生存'定性描述，缺HR/CI/P；免疫浸润关联基于EPIC/TIMER计算估计，易受肿瘤纯度等混杂；生物信息学关联+体外/移植瘤实验无法确证因果，样本量125例且未报告校正多因素OS模型；多项关联的多重比较校正情况信息不足","abstract_en":"INTRODUCTION: Metastatic dissemination is a major determinant of poor outcome in lung adenocarcinoma (LUAD). However, molecular features associated with distinct metastatic states, particularly lymph node and brain metastases, remain incompletely defined. We investigated the relationship between HAX1 and LUAD metastatic progression. METHODS: We reanalyzed publicly available single-cell RNA-sequencing data from GSE131907 to characterize HAX1 expression and associated transcriptional programs across normal lung, primary LUAD, advanced tumors, metastatic lymph nodes (mLN), and brain metastases. Findings were validated using additional public datasets from GEO and TCGA, including the independent single-cell dataset GSE69405. Clinical LUAD specimens were analyzed to assess HAX1 protein expression and its clinicopathological associations. Functional validation was performed in A549 and H1975 cells, and tumor growth was assessed using an A549-derived subcutaneous xenograft model. RESULTS: HAX1 expression and the proportion of HAX1-positive epithelial cells increased across LUAD disease states and were significantly enriched in mLN and brain-metastatic epithelial populations compared with primary tumors. In a 125-patient clinical cohort, high HAX1 expression was associated with lymph node metastasis, advanced stage, and shorter overall survival, and remained independently associated with lymph node metastasis after adjustment for T stage (OR = 2.581, 95% CI 1.161-5.742; P = 0.020). An independent single-cell dataset further confirmed elevated HAX1 expression in brain-metastatic LUAD cells. HAX1-associated transcriptional programs converged on E2F, MYC, MTORC1, DNA replication, and cell-cycle signatures, whereas brain-metastatic epithelial cells additionally exhibited mitochondrial and translational programs. Integrated analyses identified UBE2S, PITX1, GGH, and PDCD2L as HAX1-associated candidates.EPIC and TIMER analyses consistently showed inverse correlations between HAX1 expression and estimated B-cell, CD4+ T-cell, CD8+ T-cell, and macrophage abundance. HAX1 knockdown also reduced cell viability, increased the G0/G1-phase fraction and decreased the S-phase fraction, reduced G1/S-related protein levels and PI3K/AKT signaling, and inhibited subcutaneous xenograft growth. CONCLUSION: HAX1 is closely associated with metastatic progression of LUAD, with strong clinical evidence for lymph node involvement and reproducible enrichment in brain-metastatic epithelial cells. Its associations with cell-cycle programs and immune cell infiltration, together with its functional role in G1/S progression, support further investigation of HAX1 in metastatic adaptation and tumor-immune interactions.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43085176","pmid":"43085176","doi":"10.1016/j.sleep.2026.109377","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43085176/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-20","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Sleep Med","journal_full":"Sleep medicine","tier":"C","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":4.1,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 2区","warned":false,"study_type":"前瞻性真实世界观察性队列研究（无对照组，4.5年随访）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":50,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"选定表型中重度OSA患者长期使用下颌前移装置的停用率与停用原因：4.5年前瞻性真实世界随访","title_en":"Long-term use of mandibular advancement device in patients with moderate (to severe) obstructive sleep apnea: a prospective real-life study.","authors":"Buyse B, Verhaeghe V, Verschueren J, Peters M, Kalkanis A, Testelmans D","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Respiratory Diseases, Leuven University Center for Sleep and Wake Disorders, University Hospitals Leuven, …","authors_conclusion":"In this predefined OSA phenotype, almost half of the patients stopped MAD after 4.5 years, mainly due to subjective (and objective) inefficacy. However, discontinuation due to tooth movement is also a significant problem; this often goes unnoticed by the patient, and the decision to discontinue treatment is the dentist's responsibility, yet they lack clear guidelines for doing so.","ai_note":"179例中31例（17.3%）失访仅以重复邀请处理，可能存在失访偏倚且未报告失访者基线特征；研究限定为非肥胖、无显著心脑血管/代谢合并症的选定表型，结论不可外推至常见合并症的OSA人群；摘要未给出6个月有效性（AHI、ESS）的具体数值与预设主要终点，长期仅报告停用率等终点；'残余AHI升高为唯一决定因素'为观察性关联，未说明统计方法与多重比较校正；CPAP'依从性良好'无量化数值；缺少对照组，无法判断停用率相对其他治疗的优劣","abstract_en":"OBJECTIVE: To evaluate long-term use of mandibular advancement device (MAD) in a selected phenotype of patients with obstructive sleep apnea (OSA). METHODS: 179 nonobese patients (159 with moderate, 20 with severe OSA) without significant cardiovascular/metabolic comorbidities and/or severe somnolence were prospectively included. Polysomnography was performed at baseline; after 6 months effectiveness of MAD was tested by poly(somno)graphy, Epworth sleepiness score as well as snoring questionnaires. After that, patients were invited annually. RESULTS: Due to loss to follow-up, 31 patients could not be evaluated despite repeated invitations; 2 patients died and 3 patients discontinued because symptoms (including snoring) were no longer bothersome. Within the remaining cohort of 143 patients, 65 (45.5%) discontinued MAD therapy over a 4.5 year observational period. The reasons were an unfavorable balance between perceived benefit and subjective side effects (58.5%) and dental-related problems (41.5%). The only clinically relevant determinant why patients stopped due to an unfavorable benefit-side-effect balance was a higher residual AHI on polysomnography after titration. The proportion of discontinuation attributable to dental issues increased with longer duration of use. Following discontinuation, 73.8% of patients were transitioned to CPAP therapy, with good adherence. CONCLUSIONS: In this predefined OSA phenotype, almost half of the patients stopped MAD after 4.5 years, mainly due to subjective (and objective) inefficacy. However, discontinuation due to tooth movement is also a significant problem; this often goes unnoticed by the patient, and the decision to discontinue treatment is the dentist's responsibility, yet they lack clear guidelines for doing so.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43094317","pmid":"43094317","doi":"10.4046/trd.2026.0168","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43094317/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-26","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Tuberc Respir Dis (Seoul)","journal_full":"Tuberculosis and respiratory diseases","tier":"C","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.6,"zone":"JCR Q2","warned":false,"study_type":"系统评价与荟萃分析（纳入6项RCT，Hartung-Knapp随机效应、RoB 2与GRADE）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":48,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"居家高流量鼻导管用于COPD慢性呼吸衰竭的系统评价与荟萃分析：各合并点估计均倾向HFNC，但置信区间均跨过无效线，证据确定性低至极低","title_en":"Domiciliary High-Flow Nasal Cannula in Chronic Respiratory Failure due to COPD: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis of Randomized Controlled Trials.","authors":"Amer KA, Alshahrani M, Asiri MM, Asiri MA, Hamood NA","affiliation_highlight":"Internal Medicine Department, Aseer Central Hospital, Aseer Health Cluster, Saudi Arabia.","authors_conclusion":"Home HFNC may reduce exacerbations, carbon dioxide and symptom symptom burden in a heterogeneous population with COPD and chronic respiratory failure, but no pooled estimate was statistically robust. Non-inferiority for a physiological surrogate does not establish clinical equivalence with NIV; the review does not establish HFNC as an alternative to NIV and does not support a treatment recommendation. Adequately powered trials in a clearly specified population are needed.","ai_note":"摘要先强调'All pooled estimates favoured HFNC'，随后才承认CI均跨无效线，存在轻度点估计导向的呈现倾向；加重率比CI为0.01-18.35，提示事件数极少、估计极不稳定，方向性表述临床参考价值有限。单臂交叉试验以5 mmHg生理替代终点判定非劣效，作者已自行说明不能推及临床等效。方法学部分（Hartung-Knapp、RoB 2、GRADE）与阴性结论口径一致，未见主要/次要终点偷换。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Evidence for home high-flow nasal cannula (HFNC) in COPD with chronic respiratory failure remains uncertain. METHODS: We searched PubMed/MEDLINE, Embase, Web of Science, OpenAlex (from 2010) and ClinicalTrials.gov through 1 August 2026, and CENTRAL on 6 November 2026, for randomized trials in adults with COPD and chronic respiratory failure comparing home HFNC (≥4 weeks) with usual care, long-term oxygen therapy or home non-invasive ventilation (NIV). We used Hartung-Knapp random-effects intervals, RoB 2 and GRADE. RESULTS: Six trials (588 participants) differed in hypercapnia selection and clinical stability. All pooled estimates favoured HFNC, but confidence intervals included the null. The moderate-to-severe exacerbation rate ratio was 0.51 (Hartung-Knapp 95% CI 0.01-18.35). Mean differences were -8.83 points (-18.56 to 0.89) on the St George's Respiratory Questionnaire, -2.36 mmHg (-6.71 to 1.99) for daytime PaCO2 and -4.05 mmHg (-14.55 to 6.45) for nocturnal transcutaneous CO2. Evidence for admissions (one trial) and mortality (two trials) was inconclusive. In one six-week crossover trial, CO2 change with HFNC was non-inferior to home NIV within a prespecified 5 mmHg margin. Certainty was low to very low. CONCLUSION: Home HFNC may reduce exacerbations, carbon dioxide and symptom burden in a heterogeneous population with COPD and chronic respiratory failure, but no pooled estimate was statistically robust. Non-inferiority for a physiological surrogate does not establish clinical equivalence with NIV; the review does not establish HFNC as an alternative to NIV and does not support a treatment recommendation. Adequately powered trials in a clearly specified population are needed.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43097184","pmid":"43097184","doi":"10.1007/s00408-025-00853-z","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43097184/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-26","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Lung","journal_full":"Lung","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":4.3,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"前瞻性多中心注册研究（韩国慢性咳嗽注册库）· 队列观察性分析","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":48,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"咳嗽持续时间与难治性慢性咳嗽的关联：前瞻性多中心注册研究中咳嗽时长呈连续性预后信息，未见12个月离散诊断阈值","title_en":"Relationships Between Cough Duration and Refractory Chronic Cough in Adults with Chronic Cough: A Prospective Multicenter Registry Study.","authors":"An J, Shim JS, Lee JH, Kim Y, Oh JY, Yun JE, Kim YC, Jeong J et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Pulmonary, Allergy and Critical Care Medicine, Kyung Hee University Hospital at Gangdong, College of Medic…","authors_conclusion":"相当比例的患者在慢性咳嗽第一年内即被诊断为RCC；这些发现提示RCC识别不应局限于咳嗽持续超过1年的患者，同时表明咳嗽时长作为连续变量携带预后信息。","ai_note":"主要结局为医师记录的诊断而非标准化、盲法判定的RCC表型标准，诊断行为可能受医生对1年阈值认知的影响，存在结局判定主观性；样条分析'未见阈值'属未发现证据，摘要未报告样条检验效能或阈值置信区间，不能等同于阈值被排除；FeNO与咳嗽严重度仅定性描述无数值；摘要未说明随访时长、失访及混杂控制细节，信息不足。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: The 1-year cough duration threshold has been used in clinical trials of refractory chronic cough (RCC), but it has not been validated for a diagnostic or prognostic boundary. OBJECTIVE: We aimed to investigate the association between cough duration and subsequent diagnosis of RCC. METHODS: We analyzed adults with chronic cough enrolled in the prospective, multicenter Korean Chronic Cough Registry. Patients were classified as having recent-onset (8 weeks to ≤ 12 months) or longstanding chronic cough (> 12 months), according to cough duration at enrollment. The primary outcome was a first physician-recorded diagnosis of RCC during follow-up. Kaplan-Meier, restricted cubic spline, and Cox regression analyses were performed. RESULTS: Among 741 patients, 221 had recent-onset chronic cough and 520 had longstanding chronic cough. RCC was diagnosed in 39.6% and 58.1% of these groups, respectively (P < 0.001). 23.1% of patients with recent-onset chronic cough were diagnosed with RCC before their total cough duration exceeded 12 months. Longer cough duration was independently associated with RCC diagnosis (adjusted hazard ratio per doubling, 1.10; 95% confidence interval, 1.04-1.17; P < 0.001), but restricted cubic spline analysis showed no evidence of a discrete threshold at 12 months. Greater baseline cough severity and lower fractional exhaled nitric oxide levels were also associated with RCC diagnosis. CONCLUSION: RCC was diagnosed in a substantial proportion of patients during the first year of chronic cough. These findings suggest that RCC recognition should not be restricted to patients with cough persisting for more than 1 year, while indicating that cough duration carries prognostic information as a continuum.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43094394","pmid":"43094394","doi":"10.1177/17534666261512866","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43094394/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Ther Adv Respir Dis","journal_full":"Therapeutic advances in respiratory disease","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.2,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"人群横断面研究（NHIS 2015-2018与2019-2022分两期）· 潜在类别分析与加权改良Poisson回归","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":47,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"基于NHIS的潜在类别分析显示肥胖相关健康谱与成人当前哮喘及哮喘发作患病率升高相关、吸烟主导谱与当前哮喘患病率降低横断面关联","title_en":"Health profiles and asthma-related outcomes among US adults with a history of asthma: A cross-sectional study.","authors":"Mao S, Wu L","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Paediatrics, Shanghai Sixth People's Hospital Affiliated to Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medici…","authors_conclusion":"Obesity-related health profiles were associated current asthma and attack, while cost-related unmet medication need was associated with all three asthma-related outcomes. These findings highlight the relevance of considering coexisting health conditions and medication affordability when assessing the needs of adults with a history of a history of asthma.","ai_note":"横断面设计仅得患病率关联，不能推断因果或时序，潜在类别与哮喘谁先谁后无法确定。两期类别数不同（6 vs 4），跨期类别不可直接比较，而结论将两期结果合并表述。吸烟主导类当前哮喘患病率反而更低（PR 0.89）与常识相悖，可能为诊断偏倚/吸烟者就医与哮喘诊断不足所致，摘要未讨论。摘要明确提示部分关联在敏感性分析中不一致，但结论未体现该不稳定性。费用相关未满足用药需求与三项结局的关联为作者结论重点之一，但摘要未给出该因素的任何PR/CI数值，信息不足。研究非胸肿瘤领域，与胸部肿瘤临床业务关联有限。","abstract_en":"BackgroundAssociation between health profiles with asthma-related outcomes among adults with a history of asthma remain incompletely understood.ObjectivesTo identify latent health profiles and examine their associations with asthma-related outcomes among US adults with a history of asthma.DesignPopulation-based cross-sectional study using National Health Interview Survey (NHIS) data from 2015-2018 and 2019-2022 were analysed separately.MethodsWe analysed 14,386 participants from 2015-2018 and 13,924 from 2019-2022. Latent class analysis (LCA) included obesity, current smoking, and seven chronic conditions. Survey-weighted modified Poisson regression estimated adjusted prevalence ratios (PRs) for current asthma, past-year asthma attack, and asthma-related emergency room (ER) or urgent-care visit. The Benjamini-Hochberg (BH) procedure controlled the false discovery rate (FDR) across 24 primary class comparisons. Exploratory individual-factor analyses and restricted cubic splines (RCS) examined the associations with individual characteristics and age. Sensitivity analyses included alternative age and chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) adjustments, logistic standardization, fixed-measurement two-step estimation and 100 primary sampling unit bootstrap replicates per period.ResultsLCA identified six profiles in 2015-2018 and four in 2019-2022. In 2015-2018, compared with the low-multimorbidity class, the obesity-metabolic class had higher prevalences of current asthma (PR 1.08, 95% CI 1.03-1.14) and attack (PR 1.15, 95% CI 1.05-1.26), while the obesity-high-multimorbidity class had higher current asthma prevalence (PR 1.12, 95% CI 1.05-1.18). The smoking-predominant class had lower current asthma prevalence (PR 0.89, 95% CI 0.82-0.96; all q<0.05). In 2019-2022, compared with the low-multimorbidity class, the obesity-predominant class had higher prevalences of current asthma (PR 1.10, 95% CI 1.05-1.16) and attack (PR 1.22, 95% CI 1.09-1.36), while the cardiometabolic multimorbidity class had higher attack prevalence (PR 1.40, 95% CI 1.23-1.59; all q< 0.05). Female sex, COPD, and unmet medication need due to cost were associated with higher prevalences of all three asthma-related outcomes in both periods. Age showed nonlinear associations with current asthma and attack in both periods (all P for nonlinearity <0.05). Bootstrap class matching was more consistent in 2019-2022, although some associations varied across sensitivity analyses.ConclusionsObesity-related health profiles were associated current asthma and attack, while cost-related unmet medication need was associated with all three asthma-related outcomes. These findings highlight the relevance of considering coexisting health conditions and medication affordability when assessing the needs of adults with a history of asthma.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086401","pmid":"43086401","doi":"10.1016/s0022-1759(99)00034-4","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086401/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-25","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Nat Microbiol","journal_full":"Nature microbiology","tier":"A","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"5","jsub":[],"if_val":18.7,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 1区","warned":false,"study_type":"基础机制研究（小鼠模型，肺泡巨噬细胞表面标志物功能与流感感染后表观遗传重编程分析）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":45,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"full","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"肺泡巨噬细胞表面分子EpCAM促进肺炎链球菌与军团菌清除，流感感染后经TNF-NF-κB通路及表观遗传沉默持续下调，削弱巨噬细胞细菌吞噬能力","title_en":"Epithelial cell adhesion molecule on alveolar macrophages promotes the clearance of pulmonary bacterial infections.","authors":"Fisch LI, Berest I, Ouyang Y, Matsushita M, Headley M, Gasteiger G, Yamauchi Y, Kopf M et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Institute of Molecular Health Sciences, ETH Zurich, Zurich, Switzerland.","authors_conclusion":"这些发现揭示了EpCAM此前未知的作用，并凸显其对肺泡巨噬细胞表型可塑性的潜在影响（These findings uncover a previously unknown role for EpCAM and highlight its potential impact on AM phenotypic plasticity）。","ai_note":"信息不足：摘要未报告任何样本量、动物数、效应量、CI或P值，亦未说明是否使用条件性敲除/回补实验，因此流感后EpCAM下调与细菌吞噬减少之间是否为因果关系无法判断；'病毒重编程导致继发细菌感染易感性增加'为推断性表述，未见感染率或生存等硬终点；EpCAM作为胎儿来源肺泡巨噬细胞标志物的临床可转化性（如BAL标本分型、预后价值）未评估；机制链条描述性成分较重，缺乏定量支持。","abstract_en":"Alveolar macrophages (AMs) serve as a critical first line of defence against respiratory pathogens and ensure lung function during both infection and steady-state conditions. They express several surface markers, including epithelial cell adhesion molecule (EpCAM, also known as CD326), whose role remains unclear. Here we show that EpCAM is a distinct surface marker of fetal-derived AMs, distinguishing them from other tissue-resident macrophages. Although it is dispensable for their homeostatic function, it contributes to efficient uptake and timely clearance of respiratory bacterial pathogens including Streptococcus pneumoniae and Legionella pneumophila. During influenza infection, EpCAM is rapidly downregulated in AMs via TNF-mediated NF-κB signalling, and the Epcam locus undergoes sustained chromatin repression and epigenetic remodelling. Its downregulation persists after viral clearance, and AMs from virus-infected mice show significantly reduced bacterial uptake. This suggests that viral infection reprogrammes AMs, contributing to increased susceptibility to secondary bacterial infection. These findings uncover a previously unknown role for EpCAM and highlight its potential impact on AM phenotypic plasticity.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43085574","pmid":"43085574","doi":"10.1016/j.chest.2026.11.010","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43085574/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-25","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Chest","journal_full":"Chest","tier":"B","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":9.8,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 1区","warned":false,"study_type":"多中心横断面观察队列（2016-2021），ODI与多种DNA甲基化衰老时钟的关联分析","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":44,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"阻塞性睡眠呼吸暂停间歇性低氧严重度与表观遗传生物学衰老加速相关（PhenoAge与DunedinPACE阳性，一代时钟阴性）","title_en":"Epigenetic Aging and Severity of Nocturnal Intermittent Hypoxia.","authors":"Ostrovski I, Allen AJH, Zhuang B, Konwar C, Beaudin AE, Hanly PJ, Skomro RP, Kimoff RJ et al.","affiliation_highlight":"","authors_conclusion":"Greater IH severity, as assessed by ODI, was independently associated with increased biological aging as measured by PhenoAge and DunedinPACE clocks. These findings support a link between OSA and biological aging, raising the possibility of using epigenetic age measures as biomarkers of OSA-related morbidity.","ai_note":"横断面设计无法确立因果方向（衰老加速也可能影响OSA易感性）；仅报告β与校正P值，摘要无95%CI与效应量临床解释（β=0.0005的单位与实际意义不明）；多种时钟中仅PhenoAge与DunedinPACE显著、一代时钟全阴性，存在结局选择性强调的可能；人群为疑似OSA转诊人群，外推至一般人群受限；无纵向或干预验证，'作为OSA相关并发症生物标志物'仍属假设","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Nocturnal intermittent hypoxia (IH) is a hallmark feature of obstructive sleep apnea (OSA) and contributes to oxidative stress and inflammation, which in turn may accelerate biological aging. Epigenetic clocks can estimate biological age from DNA methylation (DNAm) patterns. RESEARCH QUESTION: Is greater severity of IH associated with increased biological aging? STUDY DESIGN AND METHODS: We studied adults referred for suspected OSA in a multisite sleep and circadian research network, a cross-sectional observational cohort (2016-2021). IH severity was assessed using the 4% oxygen desaturation index (ODI) from home sleep apnea testing or in-laboratory polysomnography (PSG). DNAm from peripheral blood leukocytes was assayed using Illumina EPIC arrays. Epigenetic age acceleration (EAA) and pace of aging were calculated using multiple DNAm clocks. Linear regression models were adjusted for leukocyte composition, age, sex, ethnicity, BMI, smoking, site, alcohol, diabetes, and hypertension. A false discovery rate of 0.05 was used. RESULTS: A total of 1364 participants were included (median age, 56 yrs; median ODI, 16/h; median BMI, 32 kg/m2; 57% male). Higher ODI was associated with EAA for PhenoAge (β = 0.028, adjusted P = .0048) and with pace of aging (DunedinPACE, β = 0.0005, adjusted P =.0012). No significant associations were observed for first-generation clocks. INTERPRETATION: Greater IH severity, as assessed by ODI, was independently associated with increased biological aging as measured by PhenoAge and DunedinPACE clocks. These findings support a link between OSA and biological aging, raising the possibility of using epigenetic age measures as biomarkers of OSA-related morbidity.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086832","pmid":"43086832","doi":"10.2169/internalmedicine.41.44","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086832/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Aug-12","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"BMC Pulm Med","journal_full":"BMC pulmonary medicine","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.1,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"回顾性单臂前后对照研究 · 按基线是否合并肺动脉高压分亚组比较","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":43,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"大动脉炎肺动脉受累患者球囊肺动脉成形术：合并肺动脉高压者血流动力学与运动功能改善，不合并者血流动力学无显著变化、获益限于生活质量","title_en":"Balloon pulmonary angioplasty in Takayasu arteritis with pulmonary artery involvement: a comparative study between patients with and without pulmonary hypertension.","authors":"Wang J, Zheng H, Li H, Sun L, Yiminniyaze R, Wang S, Li X, Zheng S et al.","affiliation_highlight":"National Center for Respiratory Medicine State Key Laboratory of Respiratory Health and Multimorbidity, National Centre …","authors_conclusion":"BPA对有症状的TA-PAI显示出可接受的安全性和初步疗效；结果提示基线合并PH者有初步的功能与血流动力学获益，而不合并PH者的获益主要限于生活质量而非血流动力学；需要更大的对照研究加以证实。","ai_note":"信息不足：无未干预或替代治疗对照组，前后自身对照无法排除自然病程与安慰效应；亚组比较为非随机观察性比较，且不伴PH组仅11例，统计效能有限。摘要仅报告P值而未给出6MWD、QoL、NT-proBNP的具体数值与效应量（CI），无法评估临床意义大小；全人群mPAP平均仅降约2.6 mmHg。并发症按例数报告但未说明BPA总操作/手术次数，安全性分母不明确。不伴PH组'适度6MWD增加'缺少数值支持。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Takayasu arteritis (TA) is a rare large-vessel vasculitis, and pulmonary artery involvement (PAI) can cause severe stenosis and pulmonary hypertension (PH), markedly impairing exercise capacity and quality of life. Although balloon pulmonary angioplasty (BPA) has emerged as a promising interventional option, its preliminary efficacy and safety in TA-PAI-particularly in patients without PH-remain insufficiently defined. Therefore, this study aimed to evaluate the preliminary safety and differential clinical outcomes of BPA in patients with TA-PAI, stratified by the presence or absence of baseline PH. METHODS: We retrospectively analyzed TA-PAI patients undergoing BPA. Hemodynamics, N-terminal pro-B-type natriuretic peptide (NT-proBNP), exercise capacity, and Quality of Life (QoL) were assessed pre- and post-BPA. Lesion anatomy and procedural complications were recorded. Statistical analyses compared PH and without PH subgroups. RESULTS: Among 33 TA-PAI patients, including 22 with PH and 11 without PH, BPA significantly reduced mPAP (25.41 ± 8.86 to 22.82 ± 7.94 mmHg, P = 0.005) and Pulmonary Vascular Resistance (PVR) from ( 3.06 [1.37,6.04] to 2.17 [1.35, 4.28] WU, P=0.039) in the overall population. In the PH subgroup, significant hemodynamic and functional improvements were observed, including reduced NT-proBNP (P=0.024), increased 6-minute walk distance (6MWD) (P=0.012), and enhanced QoL (all P <0.001). Conversely, the without PH group showed no significant hemodynamic changes (P > 0.05) but demonstrated modest 6MWD increases and significant QoL improvements. Left pulmonary artery lesions were more prevalent in the PH group (42.0% vs. 5.7%, P < 0.001). The procedure was generally safe, with infrequent complications, including vascular dissection (1.6%) and haemoptysis (0.8%), occurring only in a small number of patients. CONCLUSIONS: BPA demonstrated acceptable safety and preliminary efficacy for symptomatic TA-PAI. Findings suggest preliminary functional and hemodynamic benefits in patients with baseline PH, whereas benefits in patients without PH were primarily limited to quality of life rather than hemodynamics. Larger controlled studies are needed to confirm these findings.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43094316","pmid":"43094316","doi":"10.4046/trd.2026.0065","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43094316/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-26","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Tuberc Respir Dis (Seoul)","journal_full":"Tuberculosis and respiratory diseases","tier":"C","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.6,"zone":"JCR Q2","warned":false,"study_type":"社区人群筛查项目评估（2023-2024年老年社区中心主动病例发现），多因素logistic回归分析相关因素","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":42,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"韩国西南部老年人社区中心主动结核筛查：25,885人中检出31例菌阳结核，NNS 835","title_en":"Community-based tuberculosis screening among older adults in southwestern Korea: results from a senior community center-based active case-finding program.","authors":"Lee GI, Na MS, Oh H, Seo JM, Shin S, Kim WI, Jeong HY, Park DS et al.","affiliation_highlight":"The Korean Institute of Tuberculosis, Korea National Tuberculosis Association, 168-5, Osongsaengmyeong4-ro, Osong-eup, C…","authors_conclusion":"老年社区中心筛查取得了高检出产率和低NNS。在多种影像学类别中均检出菌学确诊结核，支持在老年人中采用联合胸片、症状评估与微生物学检查的整合筛查策略","ai_note":"作者称'高检出产率、低NNS'，但NNS 835与既往项目的具体比较数值在摘要中缺失，'优于既往项目'无摘要内数据支撑；摘要提及与既往韩国老年筛查项目比较，但未报告相应结果，信息不足。耐药率19.4%基于31例中的极小分母，估计极不稳定；'菌学确诊'却有51.6%归类为非活动性结核、16.1%胸片正常，分类口径存在张力；痰检查仅'有指征时'进行，存在验证偏倚，可能漏诊影像与症状均不典型的病例（恰是作者强调的'胸片正常'人群），从而低估或扭曲检出构成","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Tuberculosis (TB) in Korea is increasingly concentrated among older adults. We evaluated a senior community center-based TB screening program in Jeollanam-do Province, southwestern Korea. METHODS: Between January 2023 and December 2024, community-based TB screening was conducted at senior community centers, primarily targeting adults aged ≥65 years. Screening included chest radiography, a structured questionnaire, and sputum examination when indicated. TB was confirmed by smear microscopy, culture, and molecular tests. Detection yield, number needed to screen (NNS), and associated factors were analyzed and compared with previous elderly TB screening programs in Korea using multivariable logistic regression. RESULTS: Among 25,885 participants (mean age, 76.6±7.7 years; 69.7% female), 31 bacteriologically confirmed TB cases were identified, yielding 119.8 cases per 100,000 screened and an NNS of 835 (95% CI, 588-1,229). Detection rates were higher in males than females (229.2 vs. 72.1 per 100,000; p<0.001) and highest among those aged 75-79 years. Among confirmed cases, 51.6% were classified as Inactive TB and 16.1% had Normal chest radiographs. Drug resistance was identified in 19.4% of cases, all involving isoniazid resistance. Male sex (AOR, 2.395; 95% CI, 1.113-5.154), TB-related radiographic findings (AOR, 26.686; 95% CI, 8.311-85.687), other diseases suspected on chest radiography (AOR, 7.117; 95% CI, 2.067-24.503), cough (AOR, 5.285; 95% CI, 1.995-14.001), and sputum production (AOR, 3.157; 95% CI, 1.312-7.598) were independently associated with TB detection. CONCLUSION: Senior community center-based screening achieved a high detection yield and low NNS. Detection of bacteriologically confirmed TB across diverse radiographic categories supports an integrated screening strategy combining chest radiography, symptom assessment, and microbiological evaluation in older adults.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086827","pmid":"43086827","doi":"10.1038/s41598-026-66831-4","nct_id":"NCT05549635","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086827/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"https://clinicaltrials.gov/study/NCT05549635","pub_date":"2026-Sep-03","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"BMC Pulm Med","journal_full":"BMC pulmonary medicine","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.1,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"横断面血清生物标志物研究 · 发现队列+独立验证队列（两队列均为观察性比较）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":42,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"血清III/VI型胶原重塑标志物在纤维化型HP中升高，但其区分fHP与IPF的能力仅在部分标志物上得到独立队列复现","title_en":"Collagen remodeling is elevated in fibrotic hypersensitivity pneumonitis and may distinguish it from idiopathic pulmonary fibrosis.","authors":"Christoforidou G, Simões FB, Dræby SD, Kronborg-White S, Hoyer N, Karsdal MA, Leeming DJ, Bendstrup E et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Biomedical Sciences, University of Copenhagen, Copenhagen, Denmark.","authors_conclusion":"HP血清III型和VI型胶原重塑标志物显著高于健康人，且与是否存在纤维化无关，提示疾病中ECM重塑增加；这些标志物在一个队列中IPF较fHP升高。研究结果提示III型和VI型胶原重塑标志物反映HP中活跃的ECM转换，并可能与现有标准联合用于临床区分fHP与IPF。","ai_note":"验证队列仅PRO-C3复现，PRO-C6与C6M均未复现，但结论笼统称'这些标志物在IPF中较fHP升高'，属对未复现结果的选择性概括；标题与结论使用'distinguish/may be used to differentiate'，但摘要未报告任何诊断准确性指标（AUC、敏感度、特异度、阈值），区分能力信息不足；各标志物效应量CI为比值型数值但摘要未标明量纲与分析方法（是否校正年龄、吸烟、肾功能等）；样本量小（每组21-46例）且为横断面设计，无法评估纵向预后价值；另C6M在HP中高于健康人却仅在一个队列中IPF>fHP，生物学解释信息不足。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Idiopathic pulmonary fibrosis (IPF) and fibrotic hypersensitivity pneumonitis (fHP) are two common causes of pulmonary fibrosis. Unlike IPF, fHP is caused by a persistent immune response to an antigen. Misclassification of fHP and IPF can lead to significant delays in antifibrotic treatment, particularly in cases where the eliciting antigen cannot be identified and removed. Extracellular matrix (ECM) and, particularly, collagen remodeling is a key feature of fibrosis. We characterized ECM remodeling in HP phenotypes by quantifying serological biomarkers of type III and VI collagen turnover in comparison to healthy controls. We then evaluated the potential of these biomarkers as tools to differentiate fHP from IPF in two separate independent cohorts. METHODS: Biomarkers of type III and VI collagen formation (nordicPRO-C3™ and nordicPRO-C6™) and degradation (nordicC3M™ and nordicC6M™) were quantified cross-sectionally in serum from PFBIO-HP (NCT05549635, PFBIO-non-fHP; n = 25, PFBIO-fHP; n = 24) and healthy controls (n = 20). Biomarkers were then compared between the HP phenotypes and IPF patients from PFBIO (NCT02755441, n = 46). Findings were validated in an independent cohort, (AUH-ILD, NCT05311345, AUH-IPF; n = 43, AUH-fHP; n = 21). RESULTS: Serum C3M and C6M were elevated compared to healthy in PFBIO-non-fHP (C3M 95% CI: 0.34-0.56, p < 0.0001 and C6M: 0.46-0.81, p = 0.001) and PFBIO-fHP (C3M: 0.31-0.51, p < 0.0001, C6M: 0.47-0.82, p = 0.001). Biomarker levels did not differ between fHP and non-fHP. Serum PRO-C3, PRO-C6 and C6M were elevated in PFBIO-IPF compared to PFBIO-fHP (PRO-C3: 0.68-0.99, p = 0.038, PRO-C6: 0.56-0.83, p = 0.0002, C6M: 0.47-0.76, p < 0.0001), whereas only PRO-C3 was significantly elevated in AUH-IPF compared to AUH-fHP (1.004-1.353, p = 0.044). CONCLUSIONS: Serological biomarkers of type III and VI collagen remodeling were significantly elevated in HP compared to healthy, regardless of fibrosis status, suggestive of an increased ECM remodeling in the disease. Furthermore, these biomarkers were elevated in IPF compared to fHP in a cohort of both diagnoses. Our findings suggest that type III and VI collagen remodeling biomarkers are reflective of active ECM turnover in HP and may also be used alongside existing criteria to differentiate between fHP and IPF in the clinic.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086765","pmid":"43086765","doi":"10.1016/j.ebiom.2025.106066","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086765/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Sep-04","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"BMC Pulm Med","journal_full":"BMC pulmonary medicine","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.1,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"单中心回顾性病例对照研究（2014-2024，n=201）· 评估心电图Lead I征与COPD的关联及诊断效能","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":42,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"社区医院201例病例对照研究：心电图Lead I征与COPD强相关（敏感度87.0%、特异度85.3%，校正OR 40.6），但系按征象分组的病例对照设计，诊断效能可能被高估","title_en":"Association between the Lead I electrocardiographic sign and chronic obstructive pulmonary disease: a case control study.","authors":"Panyala N, Singh B, Munir A, Neal JM, Thapa S","affiliation_highlight":"Ball Memorial Hospital, Indiana University School of Medicine, Muncie, United States.","authors_conclusion":"The Lead I sign demonstrates a strong and independent association with COPD after comprehensive confounder adjustment. It is suggestive of but not diagnostic of COPD and is not intended to replace spirometry. Its presence on a routinely obtained ECG may serve as a diagnostic clue to prompt further pulmonary evaluation, particularly where spirometry access is limited.","ai_note":"1) 按Lead I征状态而非连续入组的病例对照设计，敏感度/特异度/PPV/NPV易受谱系偏倚影响而高估，PPV/NPV依赖本样本患病率，不能外推基层人群；2) COPD定义异质——'CT提示COPD'者无肺功能确证，摘要未给出两种定义各占比，存在误分类风险；3) 回归以Lead I征阳性为因变量、COPD为自变量，推断方向与'用ECG筛查COPD'的诊断主张不一致；4) n=201却纳入约10个协变量，事件/变量比不足，OR 40.6的CI极宽（17.6-104），提示过拟合；5) 未报告ECG判读是否对COPD状态设盲、未做外部验证、未报告该征象相对既有临床评分的增量检出收益——以上信息不足。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) is a leading cause of morbidity and mortality worldwide, yet early diagnosis remains challenging due to limited access to spirometry in many clinical settings. The Lead I electrocardiographic sign, which is defined by an isoelectric P wave, reduced QRS amplitude, and diminished T-wave amplitude in lead I, has been reported in association with COPD. This study evaluated the association between the Lead I sign and COPD in adults aged 30-70 years. METHODS: A retrospective case-control study was conducted at a Midwestern community hospital between 2014 and 2024. Patients were classified by Lead I sign status (positive vs. negative) and COPD status (present vs. absent). COPD-positive patients were identified by post-bronchodilator FEV₁/FVC < 0.70 on spirometry, or CT findings suggestive of COPD. Multivariable logistic regression was performed adjusting for age, sex, BMI, smoking history, pack-years greater than 20, hypertension, coronary artery disease, heart failure, and hypothyroidism. RESULTS: Among 201 patients, COPD was present in 83.3% of Lead I positive patients compared with 11.4% of Lead I negative patients (p < 0.001). The Lead I sign demonstrated sensitivity 87.0% (95% CI 78.6-92.4%), specificity 85.3% (95% CI 77.5-90.8%), PPV 83.3% (95% CI 74.6-89.5%), and NPV 88.6% (95% CI 81.1-93.3%). On multivariable logistic regression, COPD was the sole independent predictor of Lead I sign positivity (adjusted OR 40.6, 95% CI 17.6-104, p < 0.001). No cardiovascular or metabolic covariate reached significance after adjustment. CONCLUSION: The Lead I sign demonstrates a strong and independent association with COPD after comprehensive confounder adjustment. It is suggestive of but not diagnostic of COPD and is not intended to replace spirometry. Its presence on a routinely obtained ECG may serve as a diagnostic clue to prompt further pulmonary evaluation, particularly where spirometry access is limited.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43096889","pmid":"43096889","doi":"10.1159/res/aepag015","nct_id":"NCT05458934","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43096889/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"https://clinicaltrials.gov/study/NCT05458934","pub_date":"2026-Sep-22","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Respiration","journal_full":"Respiration; international review of thoracic diseases","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":2.6,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"病例-对照式诊断准确性研究（ReliefF+朴素贝叶斯，重复交叉验证）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":42,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"肺结节病呼出气代谢特征分析：AUC约0.76的非侵入性诊断与活动度判别模型初步验证","title_en":"Breathprint of Pulmonary Sarcoidosis: Development of a Noninvasive Diagnostic Tool.","authors":"Sievi NA, Herth J, Baur DM, Fricke K, Roeder M, Schmidt F, Ulrich S, Clarenbach CF et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Pulmonology, University Hospital Zurich, Zurich, Switzerland.","authors_conclusion":"呼出气分析在区分肺结节病患者与匹配对照及肺纤维化患者、以及区分活动期与非活动期结节病方面显示出潜力；代谢特征（尤其涉及脂肪酸与亚油酸代谢）支持其作为无创、实时诊断与监测工具的潜力，有待在更大队列中验证","ai_note":"信息不足：结论声称可区分结节病与肺纤维化，但摘要未给出该比较的任何AUC或统计数值；AUC仅0.76-0.77且未报告95%CI/P，小样本（39/39/25）病例-对照设计存在谱系偏倚风险；未说明特征选择是否在交叉验证嵌套流程内完成，存在信息泄漏隐患；'诊断与监测工具'表述超出单中心验证研究的证据强度","abstract_en":"INTRODUCTION: Sarcoidosis is a systemic inflammatory disease of unknown origin, primarily affecting the lungs and lymphatic system. Diagnosis relies on clinical assessment, histological confirmation of non-necrotizing granulomas, and exclusion of other conditions. However, current diagnostic methods are invasive and costly, making them unsuitable for disease monitoring. Existing biomarkers lack accuracy and clinical utility. The objective was to evaluate exhaled breath analysis as a noninvasive, real-time diagnostic and monitoring tool for pulmonary sarcoidosis, by identifying disease-specific metabolic signatures. METHODS: Exhaled breath samples were collected from patients with pulmonary sarcoidosis, matched controls without lung disease, and patients with pulmonary fibrosis. Patients with sarcoidosis were further stratified into active and inactive disease states. Molecular breath profiles were compared using t test and prediction models were developed based on ReliefF feature selection and Naïve Bayes algorithms. RESULTS: Thirty-nine patients with pulmonary sarcoidosis, 39 matched controls, and 25 patients with pulmonary fibrosis were included. Sarcoidosis could be discriminated from matched controls with a repeated cross-validated receiver operating characteristic-area under the curve (ROC-AUC) of 0.76, with the main metabolic changes in fatty acid and cysteine metabolism. Active sarcoidosis was discriminated from inactive disease with a repeated cross-validated ROC-AUC of 0.77, with linoleate metabolism playing a central role. CONCLUSION: Exhaled breath analysis shows potential to distinguish patients with pulmonary sarcoidosis from matched controls and patients with pulmonary fibrosis, and to differentiate between active and inactive sarcoidosis. Metabolic signatures, particularly involving fatty acid and linoleate metabolism, support its potential as a noninvasive, real-time tool for diagnosis and monitoring of pulmonary sarcoidosis, pending validation in larger cohorts. CLINICAL TRIAL REGISTRATION: The study was registered on ClinicalTrials.gov (NCT05458934) at 14/07/2022.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086779","pmid":"43086779","doi":"10.1159/000091117","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086779/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Sep-03","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"BMC Pulm Med","journal_full":"BMC pulmonary medicine","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.1,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"单中心横断面研究 · 炎症标志物对衰弱的关联与诊断增量价值分析","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":41,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"住院老年COPD患者炎症标志物与衰弱的关联及其对衰弱识别的增量价值：一项单中心横断面研究","title_en":"Inflammatory markers and frailty in elderly adults with COPD: a cross-sectional study.","authors":"Jiang H, Yang Y, Zhao Q, Duan J, Pan L, Hong Y","affiliation_highlight":"Nursing Department, First Affiliated Hospital of Chongqing Medical University, Chongqing, 400016, China.","authors_conclusion":"Frailty in elderly COPD patients is strongly correlated with inflammation indicators. Integrating inflammatory biomarkers and disease-specific clinical characteristics can enhance frailty risk discrimination accuracy in this study. Even non-independent inflammatory risk factors retain notable clinical associations with frailty, and an expanded panel of such markers may provide a more objective basis for early identification and targeted management of high-risk elderly COPD patients.","ai_note":"摘要未报告任何AUC、CI、P值或校准/重抽样验证数据，'modestly improved''confirming the diagnostic value'等表述缺乏量化支撑，信息不足。'诊断价值'结论来自同一数据集的敏感性分析，无外部验证，存在过拟合与选择性强调风险；研究为单中心横断面设计，因果方向无法确立，炎症标志物升高也可能源于衰弱相关共病或急性加重。","abstract_en":"OBJECTIVE: This study aimed to investigate the discrimination value of inflammatory biomarkers for frailty in hospitalised elderly adults with chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD), and explore the relationship between inflammatory markers and frailty in elderly adults. METHODS: A cross-sectional study was conducted among elderly inpatients with COPD admitted to a tertiary hospital between March 2024 and June 2025. Frailty was evaluated using the Fried phenotype. Univariate and multivariate logistic regression analyses were used to identify independent risk associated with frailty. Spearman correlation analyses and sensitivity analyses were performed to explore the relationship between inflammatory makers and frailty and assess the diagnostic value of inflammatory makers. RESULTS: Among 553 hospitalised elderly patients with COPD, 35.98% (n = 199) were frail. Activities of Daily Living (ADL), GOLD rank and C-reactive protein (CRP), absolute neutrophil count (ANC) and interleukin-6 (IL-6) were identified as independent risk factors of frailty. Correlation analyses showed that CRP, ANC, procalcitonin (PCT), white blood cell (WBC) and erythrocyte sedimentation rate (ESR) were significantly associated with frailty. Sensitivity analyses revealed that adding WBC, PCT and ESR modestly improved basic model's performance, confirming the diagnostic value of these markers. CONCLUSION: Frailty in elderly COPD patients is strongly correlated with inflammation indicators. Integrating inflammatory biomarkers and disease-specific clinical characteristics can enhance frailty risk discrimination accuracy in this study. Even non-independent inflammatory risk factors retain notable clinical associations with frailty, and an expanded panel of such markers may provide a more objective basis for early identification and targeted management of high-risk elderly COPD patients.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086767","pmid":"43086767","doi":"10.2196/17342","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086767/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Sep-04","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"BMC Pulm Med","journal_full":"BMC pulmonary medicine","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.1,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"系统综述与Meta分析（纳入18项RCT/19篇出版物，RoB2与GRADE评价）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":40,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"App类移动健康干预未能降低COPD急性加重相关住院及改善生活质量，仅6分钟步行距离提高：系统综述与Meta分析","title_en":"Effectiveness of application-based mobile health in reducing acute exacerbations among people with chronic obstructive pulmonary disease: a systematic review and meta-analysis.","authors":"Qi L, Shao X, Kamei T","affiliation_highlight":"Graduate School of Nursing Science, St.","authors_conclusion":"当前证据并不明确支持App类mHealth作为降低COPD患者AECOPD相关住院或改善生活质量的有效策略；但其在改善功能性运动能力方面可能具有潜力。未来试验应更清晰地界定App功能、干预框架和目标人群，以确定App类mHealth在何时、对何种人群、通过何种机制可改善具有临床意义的结局。","ai_note":"摘要未报告各结局纳入的研究数、异质性（I²）、发表偏倚评估等Meta分析关键信息，信息不足。选择性强调方面：主要结局（AECOPD住院）与生活质量均为阴性，结果段用“In contrast”突出次要/替代终点6MWD的阳性，但作者结论已如实先陈述主要阴性、仅以“may have potential”保留余地，整体口径与数据基本一致，惟6MWD为功能性替代指标而非临床硬终点，其32.2 m的差异是否达MCID未在摘要讨论。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) management is increasingly supported by application-based mobile health (mHealth) interventions. However, their effects on acute exacerbation of COPD (AECOPD)-related hospitalization and other health outcomes remain uncertain. This systematic review and meta-analysis aimed to evaluate the effectiveness of application-based mHealth interventions in people with COPD. METHODS: This review followed the Cochrane Handbook and Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analyses guidelines. PubMed, EMBASE, CINAHL Ultimate, CENTRAL, and Scopus were searched from inception to December 2025. Randomized controlled trials involving adults with COPD were included if the intervention was delivered through a mobile-device application and compared with usual care without application-based mHealth support. Risk of bias was assessed using the Cochrane risk of bias 2 tool, and the certainty of evidence was evaluated using the Grading of Recommendations Assessment, Development and Evaluation approach. RESULTS: Eighteen studies reported in 19 publications were included. Application-based mHealth interventions did not significantly reduce the number of participants with AECOPD-related hospitalization (RR = 0.97; 95% CI = 0.78 to 1.20) or improve quality of life measured by the Chronic Respiratory Questionnaire (MD = - 0.08; 95% CI = - 0.51 to 0.35) or St. George's Respiratory Questionnaire (MD = - 2.90; 95% CI = - 7.24 to 1.43). In contrast, these interventions improved functional exercise capacity, as reflected by increased 6-minute walk distance (MD = 32.20 m; 95% CI = 13.44 to 50.96). Studies assessing psychological status using the Hospital Anxiety and Depression Scale reported no significant between-group differences. The certainty of evidence ranged from low to moderate. CONCLUSIONS: Current evidence does not clearly support application-based mHealth as an effective strategy for reducing AECOPD-related hospitalization or improving quality of life in people with COPD. However, it may have potential for improving functional exercise capacity. Future trials should more clearly define application functions, intervention frameworks, and target populations to determine when, for whom, and through which mechanisms application-based mHealth can improve clinically meaningful outcomes.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086761","pmid":"43086761","doi":"10.1016/S2214-109X(22)00456-9","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086761/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Sep-04","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"BMC Pulm Med","journal_full":"BMC pulmonary medicine","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.1,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"生态学横断面研究（200个WHO成员国，WHO与世界银行公开数据）· 2021年年龄标准化死亡率为主要终点","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":40,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"WHO成员国哮喘与COPD技术呼吸照护准备度与死亡率的生态学关联：调整后未见独立关联，但描绘出21个高负担低准备度国家","title_en":"The global respiratory care readiness gap: national capacity for asthma and COPD management and respiratory mortality across WHO member states.","authors":"Alao JO, Wilkie ED, Ukaegbu CJ","affiliation_highlight":"School of Science, Auckland University of Technology, Auckland, New Zealand.","authors_conclusion":"The adjusted analyses did not show statistically significant independent associations between technical readiness and mortality. Descriptive burden-readiness mapping identified countries where high asthma/COPD mortality coincided with weak reported availability of essential inhaled medicines and basic diagnostic tools. These observations support readiness-burden mapping as a prioritisation approach for more detailed assessment of chronic respiratory care capacity.","ai_note":"主要终点（调整后准备度-死亡率关联）为阴性，作者结论转向描述性负担-准备度分型作为推进方向，存在以次要/描述性结果承接主要终点阴性的口径偏移。哮喘死亡率CI（-7.6至3.8）仍兼容临床上有意义的获益，阴性结果可能源于生态学设计的暴露测量粗糙与效能不足，而非关联不存在。技术准备度数据192国、调整模型仅155国，缺失国家的分布与原因信息不足。生态学设计无法推断个体层面因果关系，且未报告未测量混杂（如医疗可及性、诊断率）的敏感性分析。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Asthma and chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) cause avoidable mortality, yet the basic health-system capacity needed for diagnosis, monitoring, and treatment is unevenly distributed. We assessed global variation in technical respiratory care readiness and its relationship with asthma and COPD mortality. METHODS: We conducted an ecological, cross-sectional analysis of 200 countries using WHO-linked public datasets and World Bank income classifications. Technical respiratory care readiness was defined using five country-level indicators: bronchodilator inhalers, steroid inhalers, budesonide-formoterol inhalers, peak-flow measurement, and spirometry. Primary outcomes were 2021 age-standardised asthma and COPD mortality rates. Log-linear models estimated associations between readiness and mortality, adjusted for tobacco use, clean-fuel access, and World Bank income group. A burden-readiness typology identified countries with high combined asthma/COPD mortality and low readiness. RESULTS: Technical readiness data were available for 192 countries; 155 countries had complete data for adjusted models. Median technical readiness was 4.0 of 5 components (IQR 2.0-5.0), equivalent to 80.0% readiness (IQR 40.0-100.0). Readiness was lowest in low-income countries and highest in high-income countries. Low-income countries had limited availability of budesonide-formoterol inhalers (5%), spirometry (7%), peak-flow measurement (21%), steroid inhalers (35%), and bronchodilator inhalers (46%). The estimated percentage changes in mortality per 10%-point increase in technical readiness were -2.1% for asthma mortality (95% CI -7.6 to 3.8), -0.7% for COPD mortality (-4.4 to 3.1), and -0.6% for combined mortality (-4.2 to 3.0); all confidence intervals included the null. The typology identified 21 high-burden/low-readiness countries. CONCLUSION: The adjusted analyses did not show statistically significant independent associations between technical readiness and mortality. Descriptive burden-readiness mapping identified countries where high asthma/COPD mortality coincided with weak reported availability of essential inhaled medicines and basic diagnostic tools. These observations support readiness-burden mapping as a prioritisation approach for more detailed assessment of chronic respiratory care capacity.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43087143","pmid":"43087143","doi":"10.1177/14799731261508335","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43087143/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Chron Respir Dis","journal_full":"Chronic respiratory disease","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":2.9,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"单中心回顾性观察队列 · 复合终点（进展或死亡）PFS分析","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":40,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"基线血嗜酸粒细胞>0.3 G/L与纤维化型过敏性肺炎更短的无进展生存相关（单中心回顾性70例）","title_en":"Prognostic impact of blood eosinophils in fibrotic hypersensitivity pneumonitis.","authors":"Mandin V, Hassoun D, Habeau R, Moui A, Menigoz C, Sagan C, Liberge R, Blanc FX et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Nantes Université, CHU Nantes, Service de Pneumologie, L'institut Du thorax, Nantes, France.","authors_conclusion":"In this single-center cohort, BE counts at baseline differed according to PPF phenotype identified during follow-up. Reduced PFS was observed when BE counts exceeding 0.3 G/L, indicating a higher risk of progression or death. These findings require further prospective confirmation with longitudinal BE assessment.","ai_note":"0.3 G/L界值是否预先设定/如何确定信息不足，属阈值数据驱动风险；回顾性单中心、70例样本，统计效能有限；PPF表型为随访期间判定，而暴露为单次基线BE，时间先后与表型归属逻辑存在疑问；摘要提及急性发作为结局之一但未报告任何数值，信息不足；未见BE与急性发作、死亡单独终点的关联数据；作者结论口径已自行限定需前瞻验证。","abstract_en":"ObjectivesPreclinical studies support the involvement of type 2-driven inflammation, with eosinophils as key cellular players, in the pathophysiology of fibrogenesis. However, data on blood eosinophils (BE) distribution at baseline and their prognostic impact in fibrotic hypersensitivity pneumonitis (fHP) are lacking.MethodsWe conducted a retrospective, observational, single-center study including adult patients with a multidisciplinary-confirmed diagnosis of fHP between 2016 and 2022. BE levels at baseline were assessed, along with their association with the following outcomes: disease progression, death, or acute exacerbation. Clinical, biological, functional, and imaging data were collected over two years after baseline assessment. Progressive pulmonary fibrosis (PPF) was defined according to criteria used in the INBUILD trial. Progression-free survival (PFS) was analyzed using a multivariable Cox proportional hazards model based on a composite endpoint (progression or death).Results70 patients were included. Those with a PPF phenotype had significantly higher BE levels at baseline: median 0.28 G/L (p = 0.0087). Using a 0.3 G/L cutoff, PFS was shorter in patients with BE > 0.3 G/L: 417 days versus 763 days for those with BE ≤ 0.3 G/L (p = 0.0068). This association remained significant after adjustment for age, sex and baseline FVC (HR 2.85; 95% CI, 1.53-5.28; p < 0.001).ConclusionIn this single-center cohort, BE counts at baseline differed according to PPF phenotype identified during follow-up. Reduced PFS was observed when BE counts exceeded 0.3 G/L, indicating a higher risk of progression or death. These findings require further prospective confirmation with longitudinal BE assessment.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086228","pmid":"43086228","doi":"10.1016/j.intimp.2021.107675","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086228/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Sep-03","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Cell Death Dis","journal_full":"Cell death & disease","tier":"B","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"8","jsub":[],"if_val":12.2,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 1区","warned":false,"study_type":"临床前机制研究（NSCLC细胞系分子机制与联合治疗假说验证）","category":"advanced","category_label":"局晚期与晚期靶向/免疫","score_total":38,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"full","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"细胞系机制研究发现CDK1磷酸化APE1 Ser54促其降解，WEE1抑制或增强NSCLC对APE1抑制的敏感性并重塑免疫微环境（临床前、未见体内验证）","title_en":"CDK1-mediated phosphorylation of APE1 drives synthetic lethality, p53-dependent metastasis, and immune sensitization in NSCLC.","authors":"Wang J, Li J, Peng J, Zhang M, Wang X, Akinyemi AO, Alam MR, Howlader M et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Toxicology and Cancer Biology, University of Kentucky, Lexington, KY, 40536, USA.","authors_conclusion":"我们的发现确立CDK1介导的APE1磷酸化是连接DNA修复、免疫逃逸与治疗反应的关键节点，为NSCLC中CDK1-APE1-PD-L1联合靶向治疗提供机制依据；我们提出WEE1抑制激活CDK1促进APE1降解、使癌细胞对APE1抑制致敏并诱导合成致死，同时最小化对正常细胞毒性，并利用CDK1驱动的免疫重编程增强抗PD-L1免疫治疗的序贯或联合策略。","ai_note":"纯细胞系体外机制研究，摘要未见动物模型或患者样本验证，联合治疗策略（WEE1i+APE1i+PD-L1i）的疗效与安全性均为推断而非实测；CDK1对迁移/侵袭的作用方向随p53状态相反（p53野生型抑制、p53缺陷增强），临床转化时人群需按p53状态限定，摘要未给该亚组的定量数据；'抑制CDK1降低APE1靶向疗效'与'激活CDK1增强疗效'提示该轴治疗窗窄、序贯时机关键，但摘要未提供剂量、时间顺序与正常细胞毒性数据；关键实验样本量、统计方法信息不足。","abstract_en":"Cyclin-dependent kinase 1 (CDK1), a serine/threonine kinase essential for cell cycle progression, also plays critical roles in DNA damage response, gene expression regulation, and therapeutic resistance. In this study, we identify a previously unrecognized regulatory link between CDK1 and apurinic/apyrimidinic endonuclease 1 (APE1) in non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC). Both CDK1 and APE1 are highly expressed in lung tumors and exhibit an inverse correlation in protein expression levels across multiple lung cancer cell lines. Mechanistically, CDK1 phosphorylates APE1 at Ser54 to promote its degradation, whereas inhibition of CDK1 stabilizes APE1 protein levels and reduces the efficacy of APE1-targeted therapy. Importantly, activation of CDK1 through WEE1 inhibition using MK1775 enhances APE1 degradation and markedly sensitizes NSCLC cells to APE1 inhibition, inducing synthetic lethality. CDK1-mediated APE1 degradation mimics APE1 loss, leading to genome instability, cell-cycle dysregulation, and altered metastatic behavior. Notably, the effect of CDK1-mediated APE1 phosphorylation on cell motility is p53-dependent: in p53-proficient cells, phosphorylated APE1 activates p53-dependent programs that suppress migration and invasion, whereas in p53-deficient cells the same modification enhances metastatic potential. Furthermore, further investigation revealed that APE1 deficiency activates the cGAS-STING pathway and induces PD-L1 expression through the MAPK-ERK axis, thereby reshaping the tumor immune microenvironment and enhancing sensitivity to immune checkpoint blockade. Given the dual roles of CDK1 in APE1 regulation and immune modulation, we propose that a sequential or combinatorial strategy in which WEE1 inhibition activates CDK1 to promote APE1 degradation, priming cancer cells for APE1 inhibition and inducing synthetic lethality, while minimizing toxicity to normal cells. This approach simultaneously disrupts APE1's endonuclease and homologous recombination repair functions and exploits CDK1-driven immune reprogramming to potentiate anti-PD-L1 immunotherapy. Collectively, our findings establish CDK1-mediated APE1 phosphorylation as a key node linking DNA repair, immune evasion, and therapeutic response, and providing a mechanistic rationale for combined CDK1-APE1-PD-L1-targeted therapy in NSCLC.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43094391","pmid":"43094391","doi":"10.1111/jsr.70528","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43094391/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-26","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"J Sleep Res","journal_full":"Journal of sleep research","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":4.6,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"横断面病例对照观察研究 · 中重度OSA表型（REM vs NREM）神经认知特征比较","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":37,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"REM型OSA患者执行功能（Trail Making测验）与冲动性更差，尽管总体呼吸事件严重度更低","title_en":"Neurocognitive and Behavioural Correlates of REM-Predominant Obstructive Sleep Apnoea.","authors":"Fernandes M, Testone G, Bergamo G, Avvento F, Albanesi G, Centonze D, Liguori C","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Systems Medicine, University of Rome Tor Vergata, Rome, Italy.","authors_conclusion":"These results highlight the neurocognitive relevance of REM phenotype despite lower overall respiratory severity.","ai_note":"横断面设计，无法推断因果；REM-OSA亚组仅13例，统计效能有限，多个认知终点同时检验（仅对部分结果说明经FDR校正）。选择性强调：结论突出神经认知差异，但未见对主要/预先指定终点的说明，PSQI这一主观睡眠终点为阴性（p = 0.086）未被强调。样本为单中心疑似OSA就诊人群，外推性与人群限定信息不足。","abstract_en":"Rapid Eye Movement (REM) sleep obstructive sleep apnoea (OSA, REM-OSA) is a phenotype in which obstructive respiratory events occur mainly during REM sleep, and may be associated with distinct daytime consequences. This study investigated the neurocognitive, behavioural, subjective sleep and polysomnographic profile of REM-OSA. Patients were classified as having REM-OSA when the REM Apnoea-Hypopnea Index (AHI)/Non-REM (NREM) AHI ratio was ≥ 2 and were compared with patients whose respiratory events predominantly occurred during NREM sleep (NREM-OSA). Patients evaluated for suspected OSA underwent a neuropsychological battery, including the Mini-Mental State Examination, Rey Auditory Verbal Learning Test, Digit Span Forward/Backward, Trail Making Test (TMT), Frontal Assessment Battery and Raven's Coloured Progressive Matrices, together with questionnaires evaluating sleep quality (Pittsburgh Sleep Quality Index), daytime sleepiness (Epworth Sleepiness Scale), impulsivity (Barratt Impulsiveness Scale), anxiety and depression (Hospital Anxiety and Depression Scale). Of the 91 eligible patients, 17 had mild OSA and were included in sensitivity analyses, while the primary analysis included 74 patients with moderate-to-severe OSA. Thirteen (17.6%) met REM-OSA criteria, and 61 were classified as NREM-OSA. REM-OSA patients had lower overall AHI and oxygen desaturation index and, after False Discovery Rate correction, longer TMT-A, TMT-B and TMT B-A (all q = 0.003). After adjustment for depressive symptoms, REM-OSA independently predicted longer TMT-A (β = 0.298, p = 0.002), TMT-B (β = 0.235, p = 0.016), TMT B-A (β = 0.258, p = 0.018) and higher impulsivity (β = 0.237, p = 0.043), but not global PSQI scores (β = 0.210, p = 0.086). Sensitivity analyses confirmed poorer TMT-A performance in REM-OSA. These results highlight the neurocognitive relevance of REM phenotype despite lower overall respiratory severity.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086299","pmid":"43086299","doi":"10.1056/NEJMoa1106955","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086299/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Aug-12","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"NPJ Prim Care Respir Med","journal_full":"NPJ primary care respiratory medicine","tier":"C","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":4.7,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 2区","warned":false,"study_type":"社区横断面研究 · PEFR筛查患病率与危险因素分析","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":35,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"印度西部农村≥30岁成人中便携式峰流速筛查气流受限的患病率、危险因素与初级保健筛查意义","title_en":"Community-based screening for impaired expiratory airflow using portable peak flow measurement among rural adults in western India: prevalence, risk factors, and implications for primary-care respiratory screening.","authors":"Gothankar JS, Patil SV, Devane AK, Bargaje MD, Doke P, Deshmukh RB","affiliation_highlight":"Community Medicine and Central Research & Publication Unit, Bharati Vidyapeeth Deemed to be University Medical College, …","authors_conclusion":"由ASHA工作者开展的社区PEFR筛查可能是在农村初级保健环境中早期识别气流受限的一种成本效益策略","ai_note":"PEFR非金标准，摘要未提及以肺功能仪确诊，'疑似受损'的判定阈值与定义信息不足；危险因素仅报告方向性关联（'显著更高'），未提供调整后OR/CI及混杂控制信息；'成本效益'结论无成本或卫生经济学数据支持，属外推；横断面设计不能推断因果；亚组患病率无数值，信息不足","abstract_en":"Chronic respiratory diseases (CRDs) substantially contribute to India's non-communicable disease burden, especially in rural populations. Peak expiratory flow rate (PEFR) is useful for community-based respiratory screening in resource-limited settings. This community-based cross-sectional study assessed the prevalence and risk factors of impaired expiratory airflow among rural adults aged ≥30 years in Western India. Data were collected through house-to-house visits using a structured questionnaire administered by trained ASHA workers. Information regarding sociodemographic, environmental risk factors and comorbidities was obtained. PEFR was measured using peak flow meters following standard guidelines. A total of 11,359 rural adults participated in the study. Overall, 9.17% of participants had suspected PEFR impairment. The prevalence of PEFR impairment was significantly higher among older adults, males, smokers, underweight individuals, participants using unclean cooking fuel, and those with CRDs, hypertension, or diabetes mellitus. Community-based PEFR screening conducted by ASHA workers may represent a cost-effective strategy for early identification of airflow limitation in rural primary-care settings.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086266","pmid":"43086266","doi":"10.1371/journal.pone.0113048","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086266/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Aug-12","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"NPJ Prim Care Respir Med","journal_full":"NPJ primary care respiratory medicine","tier":"C","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":4.7,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 2区","warned":false,"study_type":"改良Delphi多学科专家共识（两轮，系统文献检索2020.01–2025.09，SIGN分级）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":35,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"中低收入国家COPD患者心肺风险识别、评估与管理的改良Delphi专家共识：13条推荐达成共识","title_en":"Identification, assessment, and management of cardiopulmonary risk in patients with COPD: a modified Delphi Consensus in low-middle income countries.","authors":"Hernandez-Zenteno R, Cortes-Telles A, Elizondo-Rios A, Paramo-Arroyo R, Casillas-Suarez C, Araiza-Garaygordobil D, Alvarez-Pinto J, Anda-Garay J et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Clínica de Tabaquismo y EPOC, Instituto Nacional de Enfermedades Respiratorias, Mexico City, Mexico.","authors_conclusion":"This modified Delphi consensus provides a practical framework to support systematic cardiopulmonary risk assessment and individualized management of COPD. Although developed for Mexico, its resource-sensitive approach may facilitate implementation across Latin America and other low- and middle-income countries facing similar healthcare challenges.","ai_note":"纯专家共识设计，无患者结局或临床效度验证；摘要仅报告同意度比例，未列出具体推荐内容、证据等级或未达成共识的条目数与内容，信息不足；针对墨西哥开发后向其他中低收入国家推广的外推性未经验证；方法学上无法排除专家构成与地域局限带来的偏倚","abstract_en":"Cardiovascular disease is major determinant of morbidity and mortality in chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD), yet cardiopulmonary risk remains underrecognized and insufficiently addressed, particularly in low- and middle-income countries (LMICs). We developed a multidisciplinary consensus to provide practical recommendations for the identification, assessment, and management of cardiopulmonary risk in COPD, adapted to healthcare systems in emerging countries. A modified Delphi process was conducted by a six-member steering committee and a multidisciplinary panel of 21 experts in pulmonology, cardiology and internal medicine. Clinical questions were developed from unmet needs in COPD care and informed by a systematic literature review of studies published between January 2020 and September 2025. Recommendations were graded according to the Scottish Intercollegiate Guidelines Network (SIGN) methodology and refined through two Delphi rounds with consensus defined as ≥80% agreement. Thirteen recommendations achieved consensus, including 12 (92.3%) with very strong consensus (≥90% agreement) and one (7.7%) with strong consensus (80-90% agreement). The recommendations address three clinical domains: identification and assessment of respiratory and cardiovascular comorbidities, targeted diagnostic testing, and implementation of evidence-based pharmacological and non-pharmacological interventions. This modified Delphi consensus provides a practical framework to support systematic cardiopulmonary risk assessment and individualized management of COPD. Although developed for Mexico, its resource-sensitive approach may facilitate implementation across Latin America and other low- and middle-income countries facing similar healthcare challenges.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086822","pmid":"43086822","doi":"10.1016/S0140-6736(94)90566-5","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086822/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Sep-04","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"BMC Pulm Med","journal_full":"BMC pulmonary medicine","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.1,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"回顾性病例对照研究（UK Biobank，过程挖掘分析共病诊断时序与PH诊断时机及死亡风险）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":35,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"UK Biobank中糖尿病-高血压-高胆固醇等共病记录的时间顺序与肺动脉高压诊断时机及死亡风险相关（病例对照、过程挖掘）","title_en":"Pre-diagnostic comorbidity pathways are associated with the timing of pulmonary hypertension outcomes: a case control study.","authors":"Masood M, Pan H, Delgado-SanMartin J, Ong SJ, Zhang X, Bhamji N, Thompson R, Lawrie A et al.","affiliation_highlight":"National Heart & Lung Institute, Faculty of Medicine, Imperial College London, England, UK.","authors_conclusion":"共病的时间诊断序列与PH诊断时机相关。研究结果提示代谢疾病的呈现与排序或可作为PH风险的假设生成性流行病学指标。鉴于UK Biobank中PH亚型粒度有限，这些结果应在具有详细PH亚型信息的临床表征队列中于异质PH人群中解释，并需进一步验证。","ai_note":"研究无预设主要终点，所报告的HR=1.97(P=0.001)来自探索性共病序列分析且未见95%CI，属假设生成性结果，摘要未给出多重比较校正信息；'诊断提前2年9个月'为描述性时序差，非干预效果，且诊断时机易受既往就医与记录偏倚影响；PH与COPD/HF对照间共病负担本身不同，时序差异可能反映确诊路径而非PH特异性信号；作者已自认UK Biobank缺乏PH亚型粒度、人群异质，信息不足以判断该关联在CTEPH/PAH等亚型是否成立。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Pulmonary hypertension (PH) is a life-threatening condition often diagnosed late due to non-specific symptoms and overlapping comorbidities with other cardiovascular and respiratory diseases. Although there have been advances in treatment, diagnostic delays are common, and patients are treated late in their disease course. Investigating the temporal ordering of recorded comorbidities may provide insight into diagnostic patterns associated with delayed PH recognition and adverse outcomes. METHODS: We identified 2,727 PH patients from the UK Biobank cohort of 440,014 participants with diseases diagnoses, and sampled two demographics-matched cohorts of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) and heart failure (HF) with the same number of patients as the PH cohort but were not diagnosed with PH. Employing process mining, a methodology originating from business process analysis to extract temporal patterns from event logs, the temporal diagnostic sequences of comorbidity combinations preceding PH diagnosis were compared to those sequences in patients who received a final diagnosis COPD or HF. We also assessed the relative risk of mortality given different combinations of comorbidities and the genetic correlation between comorbidities. RESULTS: Patients diagnosed with PH had prior diagnoses of hypertension (58.1%), atrial fibrillation (31.2%), and heart failure (43.2%). Process mining revealed that the temporal order of cardiometabolic comorbidities influences the timing to diagnosis of PH, COPD and HF. Patients in which type 2 diabetes was diagnosed before systemic hypertension had received PH diagnosis 2 years and 9 months faster than the reverse sequence, where hypertension preceded diabetes. For patients with a final diagnosis of PH, HF and COPD, diagnostic sequences in which hypercholesterolemia was recorded before systemic hypertension and type 2 diabetes were associated with shorter median intervals to PH diagnosis. A sequence involving diabetes, hypertension, and hypercholesterolemia was associated with a significantly higher mortality risk (HR = 1.97; P = 0.001). Additional mortality risk factors included specific orderings of metabolic conditions and comorbidity clusters. CONCLUSION: Temporal diagnostic sequences of comorbidities were associated with the timing of PH diagnosis. Our findings suggest that the presentation and ordering of metabolic diseases may serve as hypothesis-generating epidemiological indicators of PH risk. Given the limited PH subtype granularity available within UK Biobank, these findings should be interpreted within a heterogeneous PH population and require further validation in clinically characterized cohorts with detailed PH subtype information.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43094604","pmid":"43094604","doi":"10.1186/s12931-018-0728-9","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43094604/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Front Immunol","journal_full":"Frontiers in immunology","tier":"C","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"5","jsub":[],"if_val":7.0,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 2区","warned":false,"study_type":"NHANES横断面关联 + 孟德尔随机化 + 多组学整合（转录组/单细胞/空间转录组）并以体外共培养验证的观察性机制研究","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":33,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"full","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"NHANES与孟德尔随机化提示COPD对良性前列腺增生的因果效应，并经多组学鉴定前列腺组织中VCAN高表达成纤维细胞与巨噬细胞的互作","title_en":"Integrated multi-omics analysis supports a causal association of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease with benign prostatic hyperplasia and interactions between VCAN-high fibroblasts and macrophages in hyperplastic prostate tissue.","authors":"Lu L, Xiong K, Che B, Zhang Y, Shen X, Zhang H, Tang K","affiliation_highlight":"The First Clinical College, Guizhou University of Traditional Chinese Medicine, Guiyang, China.","authors_conclusion":"This study provides evidence that COPD increases BPH risk and suggests that the two diseases have partially shared immune-inflammatory and ECM remodeling features. VCAN may contribute to prostatic stromal cell proliferation and ECM remodeling induced by macrophage-associated inflammation.","ai_note":"摘要全文未给出任何效应量、95%CI或P值，NHANES关联、MR因果效应及免疫遗传分析均仅以'significantly associated''causal effect''no clear effect'等定性表述呈现，具体数值与MR工具变量信息不足，无法评估效应大小与稳健性；主要临床关联结论依赖横断面NHANES数据，MR虽称多变量分析稳定但缺乏数值佐证；VCAN机制结论主要基于WPMY-1细胞系与体外共培养，向人群前列腺组织的外推存在局限；研究主题（COPD-BPH）与胸部肿瘤临床实践关联有限。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) and benign prostatic hyperplasia (BPH) are common among middle-aged and older men and can coexist clinically. However, the direction of causality and the underlying biological links between them remain unclear. METHODS: The population-level association between COPD and BPH was evaluated using data from the National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (NHANES), and Mendelian randomization (MR) was used to assess potential causal directions and immune-related genetic features. We integrated transcriptomic analyses of both diseases and used differential expression, functional enrichment, co-expression network analysis, and machine learning to characterize disease-associated transcriptional profiles and identify shared candidate genes. Single-cell and spatial transcriptomic analyses were further used to determine the cellular localization of the key candidate, characterize associated functional states, and assess potential cell-cell interactions. Finally, core mechanisms were validated through co-culture, immunofluorescence, and other experiments. RESULTS: NHANES analysis showed that COPD was significantly associated with prevalent BPH. MR supported a causal effect of COPD on BPH risk; this finding remained stable in multivariable analyses, whereas reverse MR showed no clear effect. Immunogenetic analyses suggested partially overlapping immune features in the two diseases, and transcriptomic findings further converged on immune-inflammatory and extracellular matrix (ECM) remodeling-related changes. VCAN was identified as a shared key candidate gene that was consistently upregulated in both diseases and validated in external cohorts. Single-cell analysis showed that VCAN was expressed predominantly in prostatic fibroblasts; high VCAN expression was associated with higher inflammatory response and ECM remodeling scores and with predicted communication and spatial associations with macrophages. In vitro, co-culture with M1-like macrophages enhanced VCAN expression, proliferation, and ECM remodeling-related phenotypes in WPMY-1 cells, whereas VCAN silencing attenuated these changes. CONCLUSIONS: This study provides evidence that COPD increases BPH risk and suggests that the two diseases have partially shared immune-inflammatory and ECM remodeling features. VCAN may contribute to prostatic stromal cell proliferation and ECM remodeling induced by macrophage-associated inflammation.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086850","pmid":"43086850","doi":"10.2147/COPD.S452444","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086850/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Sep-04","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"BMC Pulm Med","journal_full":"BMC pulmonary medicine","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.1,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"单中心回顾性纵向观察研究 · 90例稳定COPD患者CPET后HRR1分组随访1年","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":32,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"稳定COPD患者运动后心率恢复异常（HRR1≤12次/分）与1年内急性加重及CAT评分恶化的关联：单中心90例回顾性纵向分析","title_en":"Association between post-exercise heart rate recovery and one-year clinical deterioration in COPD: a retrospective longitudinal analysis.","authors":"Yang T, Qumu S, Ren X, Ma X, Yu C, Xu R, Xu H, He R et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Rehabilitation Medicine, China-Japan Friendship Hospital, No.","authors_conclusion":"本研究提示HRR1与稳定COPD患者的气流受限、运动能力和全身炎症相关；HRR1是AECOPD和CAT评分升高的独立指标；基线HRR1≤12次/分的临界值与不良结局风险增加及更重的症状负担相关，支持其在识别可能受益于密切临床监测的患者中的潜在应用价值。","ai_note":"信息不足与疑点：①摘要全文无任何95%CI或P值，OR 3.224与1.020均无区间估计，无法判断统计学可靠性；②OR 1.020（CAT评分恶化）效应量近乎无差异，却被与OR 3.224并列表述为『独立指标』，存在效应量选择性并列强调之嫌；③CAT升高2分、FEV1下降110 ml、FEV1pred下降3.656%仅在异常组内描述，摘要未报告正常组对应变化或组间差值，无法确认这些变化是否由HRR1分组驱动，『68.9%至少1次AECOPD』归属不清（异常组或全队列）；④单中心n=90回顾性设计、分组为事后切点，混杂控制情况不明；⑤主要终点在目标、方法、结果间不统一（AECOPD、CAT、肺功能、炎症指标并列），未预设层级。","abstract_en":"BACKGROUNDS: The application of cardiopulmonary exercise testing (CPET) for assessing heart rate recovery at 1 min (HRR1) is of significant clinical value in evaluating disease severity, cardiovascular risk, and prognosis in patients with cardiovascular diseases. However, its utility in patients with stable chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) is still understudied. OBJECTIVES: To investigate the associations of abnormal HRR1 with Pulmonary Function Test (PFT), modified Medical Research Council (mMRC) dyspnea scale, COPD Assessment Test (CAT) score, systemic inflammatory markers, as well as acute exacerbations of COPD (AECOPD) during a 1-year follow-up in patients with stable COPD. METHODS: This retrospective study analyzed clinical data from 90 patients with stable COPD attending the outpatient clinic of the Department of Respiratory and Critical Care Medicine at China-Japan Friendship Hospital from January 2021 to October 2025. Abnormal HRR1 post-CPET was defined as ≤ 12 beats/min. Patients were then categorized into normal (HRR1 > 12 beats/min) and abnormal (HRR1 ≤ 12 beats/min) groups accordingly. We compared clinical parameters between the two groups and performed multivariable regression analysis to identify independent indicators of adverse outcomes. RESULTS: During the one-year follow-up, patients with abnormal HRR1 exhibited a clinically significant deterioration, including a median increase of 2 points in CAT score, a decline in FEV1 by 110 ml, and a reduction in FEV1pred by 3.656%. Additionally, 68.9% of patients experienced at least one AECOPD. Multivariable regression analysis revealed that HRR1 was an independent indicator of AECOPD and CAT score elevation. Specifically, compared with patients with normal HRR1, those with baseline HRR1 ≤ 12 beats/min exhibited 3.224-fold higher odds of subsequent AECOPD and 1.020-fold higher odds of CAT score worsening. CONCLUSIONS: This study suggests that HRR1 is associated with airflow limitation, exercise capacity, and systemic inflammation in patients with stable COPD. Furthermore, HRR1 served as an independent indicator of AECOPD and CAT score elevation. A baseline HRR1 cutoff of ≤ 12 beats/min was associated with an increased risk of adverse outcomes and greater symptom burden, supporting its potential utility in identifying patients who may benefit from close clinical monitoring.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43094763","pmid":"43094763","doi":"10.1152/ajprenal.90348.2008","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43094763/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Front Immunol","journal_full":"Frontiers in immunology","tier":"C","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"5","jsub":[],"if_val":7.0,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 2区","warned":false,"study_type":"小鼠LPS诱导ALI模型与LPS刺激A549细胞的临床前机制研究（AAV5过表达、抗GRP78阻断抗体与PI3K激活剂干预）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":30,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"full","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"ISM1经细胞表面GRP78抑制PI3K/AKT/mTOR信号促进肺泡液清除并减轻小鼠LPS诱导急性肺损伤","title_en":"ISM1 promotes alveolar fluid clearance in acute lung injury by targeting cell-surface GRP78 and inhibiting PI3K/AKT/mTOR signaling pathway.","authors":"Liu X, Li J, Li T, Bu J, Yang Z, Deng W","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Respiratory and Critical Care Medicine, Second Affiliated Hospital of Chongqing Medical University, Chongq…","authors_conclusion":"These findings suggest that ISM1 promotes alveolar fluid clearance and protects against ALI through a GRP78-dependent mechanism involving inhibition of the PI3K-AKT-mTOR pathway, suggesting that ISM1 may have protective effects against ALI.","ai_note":"信息不足：摘要未报告任何样本量、效应量、P值或CI，仅有定性描述，无法评估统计严谨性；未提及随机化、盲法或重复次数。全部为临床前（小鼠+细胞系）证据，肺泡液清除为间接指标（肺湿/干比、BALF总蛋白、ENaC与Na+/K+-ATPase表达）而非直接AFC测定；结论由过表达与抗体阻断反推，缺少基因敲除等反向验证。","abstract_en":"INTRODUCTION: Impaired alveolar fluid clearance (AFC) is a major pathological feature of acute lung injury (ALI). The epithelial sodium channel (ENaC) and Na+/K+-ATPase are the principal ion transport proteins that mediate AFC. Isthmin-1 (ISM1), a secreted protein with diverse biological functions, has been reported to protect against ALI; however, whether this protective effect is mediated through modulation of AFC remains unknown. This study aimed to elucidate the role and mechanism of ISM1 in regulating AFC in lipopolysaccharide (LPS)-induced ALI. METHODS: In vivo, ISM1 was overexpressed in mice using an adeno-associated virus serotype 5 (AAV5) vector, and an anti-GRP78 blocking antibody was administered to neutralize cell-surface GRP78 function. In vitro, LPS-stimulated A549 cells were treated with recombinant ISM1 protein, anti-GRP78 antibody, or the PI3K activator 740Y-P. The severity of ALI was assessed by hematoxylin-eosin staining, lung wet/dry weight ratio, bronchoalveolar lavage fluid total protein concentration, and inflammatory cytokine levels. α-ENaC and Na+/K+-ATPase α1 expression were evaluated by Western blot, RT-qPCR, and immunofluorescence, and PI3K-AKT-mTOR pathway activity was analyzed in both models. RESULTS: ISM1 overexpression attenuated LPS-induced ALI, as shown by reduced lung injury scores, lung wet/dry weight ratios, BALF total protein concentrations, and inflammatory cytokine levels, together with upregulated α-ENaC and Na+/K+-ATPase α1 expression. Mechanistically, ISM1 promoted α-ENaC and Na+/K+-ATPase α1 expression by suppressing the PI3K-AKT-mTOR signaling pathway, and these effects were significantly attenuated by GRP78 blockade. CONCLUSIONS: These findings suggest that ISM1 promotes alveolar fluid clearance and protects against ALI through a GRP78-dependent mechanism involving inhibition of the PI3K-AKT-mTOR pathway, suggesting that ISM1 may have protective effects against ALI.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43094250","pmid":"43094250","doi":"10.1097/MCP.0000000000001325","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43094250/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2027-Jan-01","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Curr Opin Pulm Med","journal_full":"Current opinion in pulmonary medicine","tier":"C","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":["综述"],"if_val":2.7,"zone":"JCR Q2","warned":false,"study_type":"叙述性综述（State-of-the-art）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":29,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"full","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"胸腔引流装置从水封瓶到智能设备的演变：叙述性综述指出数字引流系统相关RCT结果不一致，主张个体化选择与标准化流程","title_en":"State-of-the-art: evolution of pleural drainage from water seals to smart devices.","authors":"Biraris P, Punjabi A, Mehta R, Lee P","affiliation_highlight":"Apollo Hospitals.","authors_conclusion":"Chest tube drainage technology continues to evolve, offering potential benefits in monitoring, patient mobility, and healthcare utilization. Individualized device selection and standardized management pathways are essential to improve clinical outcomes.","ai_note":"叙述性综述，摘要未说明检索策略、纳入标准或证据分级，无法评估选择性；文中称'findings from various randomized controlled trials remain inconsistent'但未给出任何具体RCT数值或合并效应量，数字引流减少住院时长等获益仅以'可能'表述；引流装置选择属胸外科/胸膜病管理范畴而非胸部肿瘤核心决策。信息不足。","abstract_en":"PURPOSE OF REVIEW: Chest drainage remains the cornerstone of managing clinically significant pleural disorders and features prominently in both medical and surgical strategies. RECENT FINDINGS: Chest tube drainage technology continues to evolve, offering potential benefits in monitoring, patient mobility, and healthcare utilization. Portable drainage devices and one-way valves may facilitate outpatient management in selected patients, although complications, readmissions, and the need for structured follow-up remain important concerns. Digital drainage systems provide continuous, quantitative air-leak monitoring and may support more objective chest tube removal decisions, reduce chest tube duration, and shorten hospital stays. However, findings from various randomized controlled trials remain inconsistent. The evidence is limited by heterogeneity in patient populations, individual device characteristics, management protocols, and outcome measures. SUMMARY: We aim to provide a practical resource for clinicians to optimize pleural disease management with the different drainage devices available at our disposal. However, individualized device selection and standardized management pathways are essential to improve clinical outcomes.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43094293","pmid":"43094293","doi":"10.1111/irv.70367","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43094293/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Dec","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Influenza Other Respir Viruses","journal_full":"Influenza and other respiratory viruses","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.9,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"横断面血清学观察研究（多组比较，抗RBD IgG为中和活性替代指标）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":29,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"XBB单价疫苗接种后KP.3突破感染的抗体数量与株特异性：免疫印记回忆反应持续存在","title_en":"Antibody Quantity and Strain Specificity Following SARS-CoV-2 KP.3 Breakthrough Infection: Implications for Persistent Immune Imprinting After XBB Monovalent Vaccination.","authors":"Sato T, Goto T, Tani N, Harada Y, Ikematsu H, Horiuchi T, Akashi K, Shimono N et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Medicine and Biosystemic Science, Kyushu University Graduate School of Medical Sciences, Fukuoka, Japan.","authors_conclusion":"XBB疫苗接种者在KP.3突破感染后表现出数值上更高的KP.3特异性抗体反应，而未优先提高KP.3特异性，与交叉反应性记忆反应的回忆和放大一致；这些发现提示免疫印记相关的回忆免疫在更新疫苗接种后持续存在，并可能有助于更新疫苗接种的免疫学获益","ai_note":"关键比较（XBB vs pre-XBB组的KP.3滴度）仅约3倍且无统计学显著性，结论却以'数值上更高'正面表述，属阴性/不确定结果的乐观化解读；以抗RBD IgG替代中和活性（无真性中和试验）；摘要未给出样本量、CI、P值及采血时间窗，无法评估检验效能与混杂（感染距采血时间）；比值'相当'的表述无统计学支撑；结论延伸至'更新疫苗的免疫学获益'缺少临床终点证据；信息不足","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Immune imprinting, characterized by preferential recall of preexisting vaccine-induced immunity, has been reported following breakthrough infection (BTI) with SARS-CoV-2 Omicron variants up to XBB. However, whether this phenomenon persists after vaccination with an updated XBB monovalent vaccine lacking the wild-type (WT) antigen and subsequent BTI with the antigenically divergent KP.3 variant remains unclear. METHODS: Convalescent sera were obtained during the KP.3-predominant period in Japan from individuals with KP.3 infection without prior vaccination and from individuals with KP.3 BTI after pre-XBB or XBB mRNA vaccination. Uninfected pre-XBB- and XBB-vaccinated individuals were also included. Strain-specific anti-receptor-binding domain (RBD) IgG titers against WT, BA.5, XBB.1.5, and KP.3 were measured as surrogate markers of neutralizing activity. Antibody strain specificity was evaluated using variant-to-WT titer ratios. RESULTS: KP.3-specific anti-RBD IgG titers were significantly higher in both vaccinated KP.3-BTI groups than in the unvaccinated KP.3-infection group. The XBB-vaccinated KP.3-BTI group showed an approximately threefold higher geometric mean KP.3-specific titer than the pre-XBB-vaccinated KP.3-BTI group, although the difference was not statistically significant. The same pattern was observed for anti-RBD IgG titers against WT, BA.5, and XBB.1.5. The KP.3/WT ratio was highest in the unvaccinated KP.3-infection group and significantly lower in both vaccinated KP.3-BTI groups. Notably, the ratio in the XBB-vaccinated KP.3-BTI group was comparable to that in uninfected XBB vaccinees. CONCLUSIONS: XBB-vaccinated individuals exhibited numerically higher KP.3-specific antibody responses after KP.3 BTI without preferentially increasing KP.3-specificity, consistent with recall and amplification of cross-reactive memory responses. These findings suggest that immune imprinting-associated recall immunity persists after updated vaccination and may contribute to the immunological benefit of updated vaccination.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43096769","pmid":"43096769","doi":"10.1002/jbt.71205","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43096769/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Dec","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"J Biochem Mol Toxicol","journal_full":"Journal of biochemical and molecular toxicology","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"8","jsub":[],"if_val":3.6,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"临床前机制研究 · LPS诱导小鼠ALI模型与RAW264.7细胞结合miRNA测序、双荧光素酶与泛素化实验","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":28,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"MSC来源外泌体经miR-30b-5p/NEDD4L/PTEN轴抑制巨噬细胞炎症缓解急性肺损伤（小鼠与细胞模型机制研究）","title_en":"Mesenchymal Stem Cell-Derived Exosomes Alleviate Acute Lung Injury via the miR-30b-5p-NEDD4L-PTEN Signaling Axis.","authors":"Yu J, Wang S, Sun W, Gao J, Zhao J, Tang K, Guo W, Pan Q et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Second Department of Respiratory and Critical Care Medicine, The Second Hospital of Hebei Medical University, Shijiazhua…","authors_conclusion":"This study demonstrates that MSC-Exos deliver miR-30b-5p to inhibit NEDD4L, which stabilizes PTEN and suppresses PI3K/AKT activation to alleviate macrophage-driven pulmonary inflammation. These findings reveal a novel mechanism for exosome-mediated immune regulation and indicate that the anti-inflammatory effects of MSC-Exos are dependent on exosomal miR-30b-5p, offering potential therapeutic targets for ALI.","ai_note":"摘要全文无任何定量数据（无n、效应量、CI、P值），主要结论依赖定性描述，统计严谨性信息不足；全部为动物与细胞模型，无患者数据，临床转化外推证据链不足；miR-30b-5p的inhibitor逆转实验虽支持依赖性，但未报告回复效率与脱靶控制；无明确主要/次要终点设定，属探索性机制研究；期刊为毒理学/生化类，非呼吸或胸科专业期刊，同行评议强度需谨慎看待；数值未经四元组核验","abstract_en":"Acute lung injury (ALI) is characterized by uncontrolled inflammation and high mortality. While mesenchymal stem cell-derived exosomes (MSC-Exos) show therapeutic potential, their role in regulating macrophage function through PTEN protein stability remains poorly understood. Using LPS-induced mouse ALI and RAW264.7 models, the effects of MSCs or MSC-Exos were evaluated. Inflammatory markers and signaling pathways were analyzed via ELISA, qRT-PCR, Western blot, and immunofluorescence. The underlying molecular mechanism was elucidated using miRNA sequencing, dual-luciferase assays, and ubiquitination analysis. Gain- and loss-of-function experiments using miR-30b-5p mimics and inhibitors were performed in LPS-stimulated macrophages to assess inflammatory cytokine and PTEN expression. Both MSCs and MSC-Exos significantly suppressed TNF-α, IL-1β, and IL-6 expression in vivo and in vitro. Mechanistically, MSC-Exos upregulated PTEN levels and inhibited PI3K/AKT pathway activation by downregulating the E3 ubiquitin ligase NEDD4L, thereby reducing ubiquitin-mediated PTEN degradation. miR-30b-5p was identified as the key exosomal miRNA directly targeting the 3'UTR of NEDD4L to suppress its expression. miR-30b-5p overexpression mimicked the anti-inflammatory effects of MSC-Exos, whereas miR-30b-5p inhibition reversed the suppressive effects of MSC-Exos on TNF-α, IL-1β, and IL-6 expression and attenuated the MSC-Exos-induced increase in PTEN expression in LPS-stimulated macrophages. This study demonstrates that MSC-Exos deliver miR-30b-5p to inhibit NEDD4L, which stabilizes PTEN and suppresses PI3K/AKT activation to alleviate macrophage-driven pulmonary inflammation. These findings reveal a novel mechanism for exosome-mediated immune regulation and indicate that the anti-inflammatory effects of MSC-Exos are dependent on exosomal miR-30b-5p, offering potential therapeutic targets for ALI.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43085472","pmid":"43085472","doi":"10.1016/j.rmed.2026.109319","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43085472/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-25","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Respir Med","journal_full":"Respiratory medicine","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.3,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"叙述性综述（narrative review），经PubMed检索至2026年9月的机制、实验、临床及里程碑文献","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":28,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"肺离子通道与转运体在ALI/ARDS、囊性纤维化、NSCLC与COVID-19中的作用综述：转化成熟度差异显著","title_en":"Ion Channels and Transporters Expressed in the Lung: From Pulmonary Physiology to Selected Respiratory Diseases.","authors":"Salgado-Aguayo A, Paz-Gómez D, Navarro González MDC","affiliation_highlight":"Laboratory of Research in Rheumatic Diseases, National Institute of Respiratory Diseases, Calzada de Tlalpan 4502, Col.","authors_conclusion":"Overall, pulmonary ion channels and transporters represent important links between epithelial physiology and disease, but their translational maturity varies substantially, ranging from clinically validated therapeutic targets to mechanisms that remain hypothesis-generating.","ai_note":"叙述性综述，非系统评价：无预设纳入标准、无检索流程图、无质量评价，四类疾病的选取（ALI/ARDS、CF、NSCLC、COVID-19）为主观挑选，代表性与完整性无法核验；检索截止时间'September 2026'与当前时点存在时间标注疑点，信息不足。全文为定性描述，无任何效应量、CI或P值，结论强度依赖作者选择性引文；NSCLC部分作者已自认'most proposed therapeutic applications remain preclinical'，但标题层面仍以'From Pulmonary Physiology to Selected Respiratory Diseases'呈现，可能高估该领域转化价值。信息不足：无法判断是否覆盖阴性或相反证据。；数值未经四元组核验","abstract_en":"Ion channels and transporters are essential for maintaining pulmonary epithelial homeostasis by regulating ion movement, airway surface liquid composition, and alveolar fluid clearance. Alterations in their expression or function contribute to the pathophysiology of several respiratory diseases. This narrative review summarizes the physiological distribution and functions of major ion channels and transporters in the lung and examines their involvement in four selected conditions representing distinct pathogenic mechanisms: acute lung injury/acute respiratory distress syndrome (ALI/ARDS), cystic fibrosis, non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC), and COVID-19. Literature was identified through PubMed searches conducted through September 2026, prioritizing recent mechanistic, experimental, and clinical studies together with landmark publications. In ALI/ARDS, impaired epithelial ion transport contributes to defective alveolar fluid clearance, although clinical trials targeting β-adrenergic stimulation have not demonstrated therapeutic benefit. In cystic fibrosis, CFTR dysfunction disrupts epithelial ion and fluid homeostasis, and CFTR modulators provide an established example of successful mechanism-based therapy. In NSCLC, altered expression and activity of several ion channels are associated with tumor progression, therapeutic resistance, and patient outcomes, although most proposed therapeutic applications remain preclinical. In COVID-19, experimental and human tissue studies suggest that SARS-CoV-2 may disrupt epithelial ion transport, but the contribution of individual pathways to pulmonary edema remains incompletely defined. Overall, pulmonary ion channels and transporters represent important links between epithelial physiology and disease, but their translational maturity varies substantially, ranging from clinically validated therapeutic targets to mechanisms that remain hypothesis-generating.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43096049","pmid":"43096049","doi":"10.1002/jbt.71200","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43096049/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Dec","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"J Biochem Mol Toxicol","journal_full":"Journal of biochemical and molecular toxicology","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"8","jsub":[],"if_val":3.6,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"临床前研究 · 分子对接(in silico) + 雄性Swiss白化小鼠LPS-ALI模型预防性给药实验","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":27,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"full","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"积雪草酸经分子对接与小鼠实验评估对LPS诱导急性肺损伤的预防作用（仅报告统计学显著性，未给出效应量）","title_en":"Madecassic Acid Attenuates LPS-Induced Acute Lung Injury in Mice: An In Silico and In Vivo Study.","authors":"Meena M, Sharma M, Sagadevan I, Manohar S, Mishra AM, Talariya R, Singh S, Sharma A et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Division of Pharmacology and Toxicology, ICAR-Indian Veterinary Research Institute, Izatnagar, Bareilly, Uttar Pradesh, …","authors_conclusion":"Collectively, these results suggest that MSA may have the potential to attenuate LPS-induced acute lung injury and may be used as a preventive agent against ALI.","ai_note":"摘要通篇以'significantly'陈述各终点却完全无任何效应量、n值、CI或P值，信息不足，无法判断效应大小与统计效能；未说明随机化、盲法及阳性药物对照；仅单一剂量、单一时间点的预防性（而非治疗性）给药，与临床实际用药时机不符；分子对接'强结合'不能替代结合亲和力实验验证；小鼠LPS模型为急性炎症模型，与人类ARDS及胸外科术后肺损伤外推距离大；结论由动物预防性结果直接推向'可用于预防ALI'，存在转化过度","abstract_en":"Acute lung injury (ALI), a type of inflammatory lung disease. The lack of effective therapeutic interventions makes the search for new agents with antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties essential. This study evaluated the prophylactic efficacy of madecassic acid (MSA), a pentacyclic triterpenoid, on experimental mouse model of ALI induced by lipopolysaccharide (LPS). The MSA binding affinity to important inflammatory mediators like TLR-4, NF-κB p65 and iNOS was evaluated using in silico docking. Subsequently, male Swiss albino mice administrated MSA (20 mg/kg body weight) as pretreatment for 7 days prior to intranasal LPS challenge (40 mg/kg body weight). Lung morphometry, bronchoalveolar lavage fluid (BALF) protein content, hematological parameters, oxidative stress, antioxidant enzyme activities, and inflammatory mediators were assessed using biochemical assays, ELISA, qPCR, immunohistochemistry and histopathological examination. Docking analysis demonstrated strong binding interactions between MSA and TLR-4, iNOS and NF-κB p65. The in vivo results showed that pretreatment with MSA significantly reduced pulmonary edema, decreased protein leakage in BALF, and preserved lung histoarchitecture. Furthermore, MSA significantly suppressed neutrophil infiltration, myeloperoxidase activity and decreased the expression of NF-κB p65 protein, iNOS and pro-inflammatory cytokines. In addition, MSA significantly suppressed lipid peroxidation, as indicated by the reduction in MDA level. Collectively, these results suggest that MSA may have the potential to attenuate LPS-induced acute lung injury and may be used as a preventive agent against ALI.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43086748","pmid":"43086748","doi":"10.1093/cid/ciaa1865","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43086748/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Sep-03","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"BMC Pulm Med","journal_full":"BMC pulmonary medicine","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.1,"zone":"JCR Q2 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"单病例报告（case report）· 住院病程描述与死因记录","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":26,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"抗MDA5抗体阳性CADM相关快速进展性间质肺病在强化免疫抑制治疗后继发黄曲霉侵袭性肺曲霉病并致死的单病例报告","title_en":"Anti-MDA5-associated rapidly progressive interstitial lung disease in clinically amyopathic dermatomyositis with secondary invasive pulmonary Aspergillus flavus infection after aggressive immunosuppressive therapy: a case report.","authors":"Nguyen-Dang K, Nguyen-Ho L, Duong-Minh N, Tran-Le QK","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Internal Medicine, School of Medicine, University of Medicine and Pharmacy at Ho Chi Minh City, Ho Chi Min…","authors_conclusion":"This case highlights the dual challenge of managing anti-MDA5-associated RP-ILD and recognizing opportunistic infections during intensive immunosuppression. IPA may occur as a life-threatening complication caused by A. flavus, even in the absence of classical risk factors or typical radiological features, leading to delayed diagnosis. Routine screening for IPA using serum or bronchoalveolar lavage galactomannan should be considered in patients undergoing potent immunosuppressive therapy.","ai_note":"信息不足：单病例、无对照、无定量指标（GM指数、影像评分、肺功能、炎症指标数值均未在摘要给出），无法评估因果与发生率；作者基于1例死亡病例推导出'强效免疫抑制患者应常规筛查GM'的普适性建议，存在外推过度；BALF黄曲霉最初判为定植、后依据血清GM改判为IPA，诊断标准在病程中变更且未报告GM临界值；同时并存RP-ILD本身自然病程即极高致死，IPA在死亡中的贡献无法分离；病例亦未排除其他机会性感染或高炎症综合征（MAS）的混杂","abstract_en":"BACKGROUND: Anti-melanoma differentiation-associated gene 5 (MDA5) positive rapidly progressive interstitial lung disease (RP-ILD) with clinically amyopathic dermatomyositis (CADM) is a life-threatening condition. Prompt initiation of immunosuppressive therapy is crucial for improving outcomes. However, such treatment strategies substantially increase the risk of opportunistic infections, including invasive pulmonary aspergillosis (IPA), even in patients without typical risk factors. CASE PRESENTATION: A 59-year-old previously healthy woman reported a four-month history of progressive dyspnea, dry cough, and hoarseness, initially treated as pneumonia without clinical improvement. On admission, the patient presented with tachypnea, hypoxemia, bilateral crackles, and Gottron papules but no muscle weakness. High-resolution computed tomography (HRCT) suggested organizing pneumonia, and serological testing revealed strongly positive anti-MDA5 antibodies, raising suspicion for RP-ILD associated with CADM. Bronchoalveolar lavage fluid culture grew Aspergillus flavus, which was considered colonization due to non-specific imaging and absence of typical risk factors. From day 7 to day 9 after admission, the patient's condition deteriorated rapidly, with progressive respiratory failure accompanied by a marked hyperinflammatory state. Follow-up HRCT demonstrated worsening ground-glass opacities, consolidations, and traction bronchiectasis. A diagnosis of RP-ILD associated with CADM and positive anti-MDA5 antibodies was established. Aggressive triple immunosuppressive therapy was promptly initiated, including pulse methylprednisolone, cyclophosphamide, and mycophenolate mofetil. Subsequently, the patient developed fever and a positive serum galactomannan assay, raising a strong suspicion of IPA. Combination antifungal therapy with amphotericin B lipid complex and voriconazole was administered. Despite these interventions, respiratory failure continued to worsen, necessitating mechanical ventilation. The patient died on day 17 of hospitalization due to acute respiratory distress syndrome and septic shock. CONCLUSION: This case highlights the dual challenge of managing anti-MDA5-associated RP-ILD and recognizing opportunistic infections during intensive immunosuppression. IPA may occur as a life-threatening complication caused by A. flavus, even in the absence of classical risk factors or typical radiological features, leading to delayed diagnosis. Routine screening for IPA using serum or bronchoalveolar lavage galactomannan should be considered in patients undergoing potent immunosuppressive therapy.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43095871","pmid":"43095871","doi":"10.1152/ajplung.90113.2026","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43095871/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-26","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"Am J Physiol Lung Cell Mol Physiol","journal_full":"American journal of physiology. Lung cellular and molecular physiology","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"11","jsub":[],"if_val":3.8,"zone":"JCR Q1 · 3区","warned":false,"study_type":"转基因小鼠模型构建与表型表征研究（动物实验，呼吸调控机制）","category":"pulm","category_label":"非肿瘤呼吸病","score_total":25,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"degraded","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"Phox2b 25-Ala 扩增突变小鼠重现 CCHS 样表型：新生期低通气与高碳酸血症通气反应钝化，75% 幼鼠围生期死亡，25% 可存活至成年","title_en":"Phox2b 25-Ala expansion leads to Congenital Central Hypoventilation Syndrome like phenotypes in mice.","authors":"Toubas M, Williams M, Félix MS, Roux JC, Chapelle XP, Villard L, Beckouche N, Viemari JC et al.","affiliation_highlight":"Aix-Marseille Univ, Inserm, MMG, Marseille, France.","authors_conclusion":"The +5 alanine expansion that causes CCHS reproduces CCHS-like phenotypes in mice. Phox2b25Ala/+ mice suffer from life-threatening hypoventilation that leads to premature death at birth and a lack of chemosensitivity. However, 25% of phox2b25Ala/+ mice survive until adulthood, representing a valuable opportunity for drug testing in CCHS.","ai_note":"动物模型研究，摘要未提供样本量、统计方法与效应量数值，仅有比例描述，方法学细节信息不足；25% 存活者可用于药物测试属作者外推，未有干预验证；与胸部肿瘤/胸外科临床决策无直接关联","abstract_en":"Congenital central hypoventilation syndrome (CCHS) is a rare genetic disorder caused mainly by PHOX2B mutations and characterized by severe impairment of the autonomic nervous system and central control of breathing. The cardinal feature of CCHS is hypoventilation during sleep and an impaired hypercapnic ventilatory response. This defect has been linked, in part, to anatomical and functional abnormalities of phox2b-expressing neurons in the retrotrapezoid nucleus (RTN), a key component of central CO₂ chemoreception. Although existing mouse models have provided major mechanistic insights, the severe and often perinatal phenotype of several models has limited their use for longer-term therapeutic testing. Here, we generated and characterized, for the first time, a new mouse model bearing the +5 alanine (+5Ala) expansion mutation (phox2b25Ala/+ mice) that reproduces CCHS-like phenotypes described in humans. Phox2b25Ala/+ pups suffered from hypoventilation and had a blunted response to hypercapnia at birth, leading to premature death in 75% of the pups. At the network level, the frequency of inspiratory activity in vitro was significantly reduced in phox2b25Ala/+ mice, and the response to acidosis was affected. At the cellular level, phox2b25Ala/+ mice had a reduced number of phox2b-expressing RTN neurons, with this reduction being less pronounced in the 25% of pups that survived. In conclusion, the +5 alanine expansion that causes CCHS reproduces CCHS-like phenotypes in mice. Phox2b25Ala/+ mice suffer from life-threatening hypoventilation that leads to premature death at birth and a lack of chemosensitivity. However, 25% of phox2b25Ala/+ mice survive until adulthood, representing a valuable opportunity for drug testing in CCHS.","curated":false},{"id":"pmid_43094088","pmid":"43094088","doi":"10.1097/RTI.0000000000000920","nct_id":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/43094088/","notice_url":"","trial_url":"","pub_date":"2026-Nov-26","briefing_date":"2026-11-27","journal_abbr":"J Thorac Imaging","journal_full":"Journal of thoracic imaging","tier":"D","tier_scheme":"v4","jcat":"4","jsub":[],"if_val":null,"zone":"未收录","warned":false,"study_type":"期刊专题研讨会综述章节（叙述性影像学综述，非原创研究）","category":"surgery","category_label":"微创与无管化胸外科","score_total":25,"score_source":"llm","publish_state":"full","status":{"kind":"ok","note":"","notice_pmid":"","notice_ref":"","impact_known":true},"title_zh":"膈肌破裂、疝、囊肿与肿瘤的影像学综述（叙述性综述，无研究数据）","title_en":"Diaphragm Ruptures, Hernias, Cysts, and Tumors.","authors":"Diaz A, Lima APS, Cheng A, Godwin JD","affiliation_highlight":"Department of Radiology.","authors_conclusion":"","ai_note":"信息不足：摘要为综述性章节提纲，无研究设计、样本量、终点或任何数值结果；无法评估证据强度，亦无阴性/阳性结论可言。仅按教学性影像综述对待，不能作为临床决策依据。","abstract_en":"This section of the symposium first addresses traumatic diaphragmatic hernia, a rare but important and underrecognized consequence of blunt and penetrating trauma. We next discuss nontraumatic hernia in adults, including spontaneous and congenital hernia, intercostal hernia, hiatal hernia, Bochdalek hernia, Morgagni hernia, and iatrogenic hernia. Finally, cysts and tumors that primarily and secondarily involve the diaphragm are described. For all these entities, we discuss the pathophysiology that leads to the development of a hernia, provide example cases from our institution, and describe the findings on chest radiographs and computed tomography scans.","curated":false}],"journal_meta":{"LANCET":"9","N ENGL J MED":"9","THE NEW ENGLAND JOURNAL OF MEDICINE":"9","NEW ENGLAND JOURNAL OF MEDICINE":"9","ANN ONCOL":"2","ANNALS OF ONCOLOGY : OFFICIAL JOURNAL OF THE EUROPEAN SOCIETY FOR MEDICAL ONCOLOGY":"2","ANNALS OF ONCOLOGY":"2","NAT REV DIS PRIMERS":"9","NATURE REVIEWS. DISEASE PRIMERS":"9","NATURE REVIEWS DISEASE PRIMERS":"9","JAMA":"9","JAMA-JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN MEDICAL ASSOCIATION":"9","NATURE":"9","CANCER CELL":"2","BMJ : BRITISH MEDICAL JOURNAL":"9","BMJ-BRITISH MEDICAL JOURNAL":"9","BMJ":"9","NAT MED":"9","NATURE MEDICINE":"9","SCIENCE":"9","CELL":"9","J CLIN ONCOL":"2","JOURNAL OF CLINICAL ONCOLOGY : OFFICIAL JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN SOCIETY OF CLINICAL ONCOLOGY":"2","JOURNAL OF CLINICAL ONCOLOGY":"2","LANCET RESPIR MED":"11","THE LANCET. RESPIRATORY MEDICINE":"11","LANCET RESPIRATORY MEDICINE":"11","LANCET ONCOL":"2","THE LANCET. ONCOLO