I’m planning a detailed test matrix to ensure the fallback oracle handles offline states correctly by monitoring browser online status and server connections independently. I want to confirm navigation behavior under offline conditions, check various HTTP responses including errors and redirects, and verify cache integrity through digest computations. Additionally, I’m tracking Chrome’s service worker response flags and testing worker script updates without affecting current navigation.
